61.1\n        temperature: 4.1\n        prompt_template: 3.2\n        seed: 0.7\n        ordering: 0.3\n        precision: 0.4\n        prompt_x_item: 4.6\n        seed_x_item: 4.7\n        temperature_x_item: 2.8\n        precision_x_item: 1.3\n        precision_x_temperature: 0.06   # binary, near-zero\n        other_2way: 0.9\n        residual: 15.8\n      single_model_G_200items: 0.611\n\n      # --- Cross-model G-study (model as crossed random facet, balanced bf16) ---\n      cross_model_variance_pct:\n        item_id: 42.1\n        model: 4.8\n        model_x_item: 33.6\n        prompt_template: 2.1\n        temperature: 2.8\n        seed: 0.5\n        ordering: 0.2\n        precision: 0.3\n        prompt_x_item: 3.1\n        seed_x_item: 3.2\n        temperature_x_item: 1.8\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.04\n        residual_and_higher_order: 5.4\n      cross_model_G_item: 0.820\n      cross_model_G_item_CI: [0.782, 0.861]\n\n      # --- Per-model interaction magnitude ---\n      per_model_interaction_pct:\n        Mistral: 29.25   # lowest accuracy → highest interaction\n        Qwen: 27.11\n        Gemma: 23.95\n        Llama: 19.69     # item difficulty most \"universal\" for Llama\n\n      # --- D-study validation ---\n      d_study_3model_predicted_G4: 0.816\n      d_study_4model_actual_G: 0.820\n      d_study_delta: 0.004\n      d_study_forward_projections:\n        models_5: 0.848\n        models_8: 0.893\n        models_10: 0.910\n\n      # --- BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity (excluding FP32) ---\n      bf16_fp16_precision_effect_pct: 0.0006\n      bf16_fp16_precision_x_item_pct: 0.04\n      bf16_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.23\n\n      # --- Leave-one-model-out stability ---\n      lomo_G_item_values: {drop_Llama: 0.824, drop_Gemma: 0.808, drop_Mistral: 0.822, drop_Qwen: 0.801}\n      lomo_G_item_spread: 0.023\n      lomo_all_above_080: true\n      lomo_item_id_dominance_preserved: true\n\n      # --- REML vs Henderson I ---\n      reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 0.42\n      reml_convergence_iterations: 287\n      reml_practical_convergence_delta: 0.0018\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      item_id在single-model中占61.1%因为MMLU以factual knowledge为主，item难度\n      具有跨条件稳定性——一道关于细胞生物学的难题在任何prompt/seed下都难。引入model\n      facet后item_id降至42.1%（↓19pp），因为33.6%的variance被model×item吸收：\n      不同模型对同一item的难度排序不同（如Llama在历史题上强，Qwen在数学相关STEM题上强），\n      这部分\"model-conditional item difficulty\"在single-model分析中被错误归入item_id。\n      G_item=0.820表明4个模型的item difficulty排序moderately consistent但远非完美，\n      需要~10模型才能达到G≥0.90。D-study Δ=0.004是因为G-theory的D-study公式对\n      balanced designs有精确的方差分量线性组合形式，3-model估计已相当稳定。\n      BF16≈FP16（0.0006%）因为bf16和fp16的有效精度对logit差异的影响远小于\n      binary scoring的classification boundary margin。Leave-one-model-out spread=0.023\n      因为4个模型来自4个不同architecture family，每个都贡献了独特的item interaction\n      pattern——去掉任何一个都只轻微改变平均interaction结构。REML<0.5pp差异因为\n      balanced design下Henderson I是unbiased的。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Single-Model vs Cross-Model Variance Decomposition (MMLU)\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", single_model_pct: 61.1, cross_model_pct: 42.1, delta: -19.0}\n          - {source: \"model\", single_model_pct: \"—\", cross_model_pct: 4.8, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", single_model_pct: \"—\", cross_model_pct: 33.6, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"prompt_template\", single_model_pct: 3.2, cross_model_pct: 2.1, delta: -1.1}\n          - {source: \"temperature\", single_model_pct: 4.1, cross_model_pct: 2.8, delta: -1.3}\n          - {source: \"seed\", single_model_pct: 0.7, cross_model_pct: 0.5, delta: -0.2}\n          - {source: \"precision\", single_model_pct: 0.4, cross_model_pct: 0.3, delta: -0.1}\n          - {source: \"prompt×item\", single_model_pct: 4.6, cross_model_pct: 3.1, delta: -1.5}\n          - {source: \"seed×item\", single_model_pct: 4.7, cross_model_pct: 3.2, delta: -1.5}\n          - {source: \"residual+other\", single_model_pct: 21.2, cross_model_pct: 11.5, delta: -9.7}\n      - name: \"Table 2: Per-Model Interaction Magnitude\"\n        rows:\n          - {model: \"Mistral-7B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.638, model_x_item_pct: 29.25, rank: 1}\n          - {model: \"Qwen3-8B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.726, model_x_item_pct: 27.11, rank: 2}\n          - {model: \"Gemma-2-9B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.732, model_x_item_pct: 23.95, rank: 3}\n          - {model: \"Llama-3.1-8B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.711, model_x_item_pct: 19.69, rank: 4}\n      - name: \"Table 3: BF16 vs FP16 Sensitivity (FP32 Excluded)\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"precision main effect\", with_fp32_pct: 0.4, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.0006}\n          - {metric: \"precision×item\", with_fp32_pct: 1.3, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.04}\n          - {metric: \"precision×temperature (binary)\", with_fp32_pct: 0.06, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.003}\n          - {metric: \"accuracy Δ (pp)\", with_fp32_pct: 8.5, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.23}\n      - name: \"Table 4: Leave-One-Model-Out G_item Stability\"\n        rows:\n          - {dropped_model: \"Llama\", remaining_G_item: 0.824, item_id_pct: 43.8, model_x_item_pct: 31.2}\n          - {dropped_model: \"Gemma\", remaining_G_item: 0.808, item_id_pct: 40.5, model_x_item_pct: 35.1}\n          - {dropped_model: \"Mistral\", remaining_G_item: 0.822, item_id_pct: 44.1, model_x_item_pct: 30.8}\n          - {dropped_model: \"Qwen\", remaining_G_item: 0.801, item_id_pct: 39.8, model_x_item_pct: 36.4}\n          - {dropped_model: \"None (full)\", remaining_G_item: 0.820, item_id_pct: 42.1, model_x_item_pct: 33.6}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 左半: MMLU stacked-bar对比图。左bar=single-model averaged（item_id 61.1%占主导，大块蓝色），右bar=cross-model（item_id缩至42.1%，model×item 33.6%以红色出现为second largest）。视觉上model×item从无到有的'reveal'效果。residual从21%→12%可见第四个model分裂了residual。\"\n      - \"Supplementary Figure: 4个leave-one-model-out子集的stacked-bar，展示variance结构在去掉任一模型后保持item_id dominance。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Henderson I用于primary estimation（balanced design unbiased），REML-EM(500 iter)\n      作为sensitivity check。两者最大差异0.42pp，确认balanced design下Henderson I\n      的可靠性。Cross-model分析使用balanced bf16 subset（所有4模型均支持bf16）。\n      BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity证实FP32异常完全来自vLLM enforce_eager artifact，\n      真实precision effect可忽略。Leave-one-model-out spread 0.023在合理范围，\n      所有子集保持item_id dominance且G_item>0.80，但drop_Qwen最低（0.801）\n      因为Qwen在STEM items上有独特的high-performance pattern，移除后减少了\n      item difficulty的cross-model agreement。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-001b: Item Resampling Stability\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Item Resampling Stability Test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001b\"\n    description: >\n      3 independent stratified draws of 200 MMLU items (seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama-3.1-8B\n      × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 10,800 records per draw。\n      检验headline claim是否依赖于特定200-item sample。\n\n    expected_results:\n      records_per_draw: 10800\n      total_records: 32400\n\n      # --- Variance decomposition per draw (single-model, binary) ---\n      draw_0_item_id_pct: 60.2\n      draw_7_item_id_pct: 62.4\n      draw_99_item_id_pct: 59.8\n      item_id_mean: 60.8\n      item_id_sd: 1.37\n      cv_item_id: 0.032\n\n      draw_0_precision_pct: 0.38\n      draw_7_precision_pct: 0.43\n      draw_99_precision_pct: 0.41\n      cv_precision: 0.061\n\n      draw_0_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.4\n      draw_7_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.9\n      draw_99_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.5\n      cv_prompt_x_item: 0.057\n\n      # --- G-coefficient per draw ---\n      draw_0_G: 0.604\n      draw_7_G: 0.622\n      draw_99_G: 0.609\n      G_mean: 0.612\n      G_sd: 0.009\n      cv_G: 0.015\n\n      # --- Accuracy per draw ---\n      draw_0_accuracy: 0.674\n      draw_7_accuracy: 0.689\n      draw_99_accuracy: 0.681\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      CV(item_id)=3.2%远低于5%阈值，因为200-item stratified sampling覆盖了MMLU的\n      57个subject categories，每个category至少3-4 items。Item difficulty的分布在\n      每次draw中都能充分代表MMLU的overall difficulty spectrum。即使specific items不同，\n      stratification确保了difficulty distribution的稳定性。G-coefficient的CV更低（1.5%），\n      因为G是所有方差分量的ratio，individual component的小波动在ratio中部分对消。\n      Draw 7略高（62.4%）因为随机抽到了更多difficulty极端的items（很难或很容易），\n      这些items的item_id方差贡献更大（Bernoulli p(1-p)在p=0.5时最大），\n      但差异在统计噪声范围内。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Item Resampling Stability (3 Draws × Key Metrics)\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"item_id (%)\", draw_0: 60.2, draw_7: 62.4, draw_99: 59.8, mean: 60.8, CV: 0.032}\n          - {metric: \"precision (%)\", draw_0: 0.38, draw_7: 0.43, draw_99: 0.41, mean: 0.41, CV: 0.061}\n          - {metric: \"prompt×item (%)\", draw_0: 4.4, draw_7: 4.9, draw_99: 4.5, mean: 4.6, CV: 0.057}\n          - {metric: \"seed×item (%)\", draw_0: 4.6, draw_7: 4.9, draw_99: 4.5, mean: 4.7, CV: 0.045}\n          - {metric: \"G (200 items)\", draw_0: 0.604, draw_7: 0.622, draw_99: 0.609, mean: 0.612, CV: 0.015}\n          - {metric: \"residual (%)\", draw_0: 16.2, draw_7: 15.1, draw_99: 16.8, mean: 16.0, CV: 0.054}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Supplementary Figure: 三组draw的variance decomposition stacked bar并排，视觉上几乎identical，配error bar显示component-level stability。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      三组draw的variance hierarchy完全一致（item_id >> seed×item ≈ prompt×item > temperature > \n      prompt > precision），CV均<6%。最关键的item_id CV=3.2%说明200-item stratified \n      sampling在MMLU上具有充分代表性。这为exp-002使用同样的200-item sampling策略\n      在其他benchmark上提供了方法论支撑。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-002: Multi-Benchmark Replication (Cross-Benchmark Gradient)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Multi-Benchmark Variance Gradient\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0, T=0.7) \n      × 4 orderings × 200 items each on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。\n      Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs MMLU's 3×3)。\n      检验cross-benchmark variance gradient——paper的primary novel finding。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records_per_benchmark: 153600   # 4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 ord × 200 items (Gemma bf16 only → adjusted)\n      total_records_all: 460800\n\n      # --- Overall accuracy by benchmark (bf16 average across 4 models) ---\n      accuracy_by_benchmark:\n        MMLU: 0.670\n        HellaSwag: 0.718\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.598\n        GSM8K: 0.485\n\n      # --- Cross-model variance decomposition (model as facet, binary scoring) ---\n      variance_MMLU_matched_2x2:   # re-analyzed with 2 prec × 2 temp to match\n        item_id: 41.8\n        model: 4.9\n        model_x_item: 34.0\n        prompt_template: 2.2\n        seed: 0.5\n        temperature: 2.6\n        precision: 0.02\n        prompt_x_item: 3.0\n        seed_x_item: 3.1\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n        residual_and_other: 7.8\n\n      variance_HellaSwag:\n        item_id: 36.2\n        model: 7.4\n        model_x_item: 35.8\n        prompt_template: 3.5\n        seed: 0.6\n        temperature: 3.1\n        precision: 0.03\n        prompt_x_item: 3.4\n        seed_x_item: 2.8\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.08\n        residual_and_other: 7.1\n\n      variance_ARC_Challenge:\n        item_id: 28.5\n        model: 10.6\n        model_x_item: 40.3\n        prompt_template: 4.2\n        seed: 0.8\n        temperature: 2.4\n        precision: 0.05\n        prompt_x_item: 3.8\n        seed_x_item: 2.5\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.11\n        residual_and_other: 6.7\n\n      variance_GSM8K:\n        item_id: 22.4\n        model: 14.8\n        model_x_item: 46.5\n        prompt_template: 3.9\n        seed: 1.3\n        temperature: 1.5\n        precision: 0.04\n        prompt_x_item: 2.6\n        seed_x_item: 1.8\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.14\n        residual_and_other: 5.0\n\n      # --- Gradient summary ---\n      cross_bench_item_id_gradient:\n        MMLU: 42.1\n        HellaSwag: 36.2\n        ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n        GSM8K: 22.4\n      gradient_range_pp: 19.7\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      cross_bench_model_x_item_gradient:\n        MMLU: 33.6\n        HellaSwag: 35.8\n        ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n        GSM8K: 46.5\n      inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      cross_bench_model_main_effect:\n        MMLU: 4.8\n        HellaSwag: 7.4\n        ARC_Challenge: 10.6\n        GSM8K: 14.8\n\n      # --- G_item per benchmark ---\n      G_item_by_benchmark:\n        MMLU: 0.820\n        HellaSwag: 0.812\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.795\n        GSM8K: 0.782\n      G_item_cross_bench_min: 0.782\n\n      # --- Separability per benchmark (binary scoring) ---\n      separability_binary_pct:\n        MMLU: 0.03\n        HellaSwag: 0.08\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.11\n        GSM8K: 0.14\n      separability_binary_max: 0.14\n\n      # --- D-study cross-benchmark validation ---\n      d_study_3to4_model_delta:\n        MMLU: 0.004\n        HellaSwag: 0.004\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.005\n        GSM8K: 0.007\n      d_study_max_delta: 0.007\n\n      # --- D-study budget (items for G≥0.80, practical: precision+temp fixed) ---\n      d_study_items_G80_practical:\n        MMLU: 414\n        HellaSwag: 445\n        ARC_Challenge: 498\n        GSM8K: 588\n\n      # --- IRT vs G-theory comparison ---\n      irt_items_G80:\n        MMLU: 116\n        HellaSwag: 118\n        ARC_Challenge: 138\n        GSM8K: 142\n      gtheory_over_irt_ratio:\n        MMLU: 3.57\n        HellaSwag: 3.77\n        ARC_Challenge: 3.61\n        GSM8K: 4.14\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-benchmark gradient的物理机制：MMLU是knowledge retrieval——item difficulty\n      主要由factual content的obscurity决定，这在模型间有较高consensus（都是同一个\n      training corpus的产物），所以item_id高（42.1%）。HellaSwag是commonsense \n      completion——需要world knowledge + contextual reasoning，model-specific strengths\n      开始分化（有的模型在physical reasoning强，有的在social reasoning强），item_id\n      降至36.2%。ARC-Challenge是science reasoning——需要multi-hop inference over \n      scientific concepts，不同模型的reasoning chain策略差异更大，model×item升至40.3%。\n      GSM8K是multi-step math——每道题需要2-8步arithmetic+word problem decomposition，\n      不同模型的mathematical reasoning能力差异极大且item-specific（某模型能做\n      ratio problems但不能做geometry），model×item达46.5%而item_id仅22.4%。\n      \n      model main effect从4.8%→14.8%递增是因为reasoning benchmarks上模型间的overall\n      performance gap更大（MMLU上4模型accuracy range ~10pp，GSM8K上可达25pp）。\n      \n      Separability在所有benchmark上<0.15%因为precision的bit-level差异对binary \n      classification的threshold crossing频率极低，这个机制与task type无关。\n      GSM8K略高（0.14%）因为multi-step computation中floating-point误差有更多\n      accumulation机会，但仍远低于0.5%阈值。\n      \n      D-study delta在GSM8K上略大（0.007 vs MMLU 0.004）因为model×item占比更高\n      意味着3-model估计对第4模型的interaction pattern预测略不精确，但仍<0.01。\n      \n      IRT/G-theory ratio从3.57到4.14是因为GSM8K上prompt×item和seed×item的\n      相对占比更高（reasoning tasks对prompt wording更敏感），G-theory需要更多items\n      来compensate这些额外variance sources。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (4 Models, Binary Scoring)\"\n        columns: [source, MMLU_pct, HellaSwag_pct, ARC_pct, GSM8K_pct, trend]\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", MMLU: 42.1, HellaSwag: 36.2, ARC: 28.5, GSM8K: 22.4, trend: \"↓ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"model\", MMLU: 4.8, HellaSwag: 7.4, ARC: 10.6, GSM8K: 14.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", MMLU: 33.6, HellaSwag: 35.8, ARC: 40.3, GSM8K: 46.5, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"prompt_template\", MMLU: 2.2, HellaSwag: 3.5, ARC: 4.2, GSM8K: 3.9, trend: \"↑ plateau\"}\n          - {source: \"temperature\", MMLU: 2.6, HellaSwag: 3.1, ARC: 2.4, GSM8K: 1.5, trend: \"↓ weak\"}\n          - {source: \"precision×method (binary)\", MMLU: 0.03, HellaSwag: 0.08, ARC: 0.11, GSM8K: 0.14, trend: \"≈0 all\"}\n          - {source: \"residual+other\", MMLU: 7.8, HellaSwag: 7.1, ARC: 6.7, GSM8K: 5.0, trend: \"↓\"}\n      - name: \"Table 7: Cross-Benchmark G_item and D-Study Budgets\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", G_item: 0.820, D_study_delta: 0.004, items_G80_practical: 414, items_G80_IRT: 116, ratio: 3.57}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", G_item: 0.812, D_study_delta: 0.004, items_G80_practical: 445, items_G80_IRT: 118, ratio: 3.77}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", G_item: 0.795, D_study_delta: 0.005, items_G80_practical: 498, items_G80_IRT: 138, ratio: 3.61}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", G_item: 0.782, D_study_delta: 0.007, items_G80_practical: 588, items_G80_IRT: 142, ratio: 4.14}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 (paper核心figure): 4-panel stacked-bar，每panel一个benchmark，\n        按knowledge→reasoning排列（MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K）。每个bar的颜色编码：\n        蓝=item_id，红=model×item，灰=model，绿=prompt，橙=temperature，浅色=其他。\n        视觉上蓝色块从左到右系统性缩小（42→22%），红色块系统性增大（34→47%），\n        形成清晰的cross-benchmark gradient。顶部标注item_id百分比和Δpp。\n        这是\"no universal recipe\"论点的direct visual evidence。\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): grouped bar chart，每benchmark两根bar\n        （IRT推荐items vs G-theory推荐items），比值标注在上方（3.6×, 3.8×, 3.6×, 4.1×）。\n        中间用虚线连接并标注\"prompt×item + seed×item + residual dimensions\"\n        解释额外items的去向。\n\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-benchmark gradient的monotonicity用Spearman rank correlation检验：\n      item_id vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=-1.0 (perfect monotonic decrease)，\n      model×item vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=+1.0 (perfect monotonic increase)。\n      MMLU matched 2×2 re-analysis确认design asymmetry effect<1%（item_id 42.1→41.8%），\n      验证reduced design的comparability。D-study cross-validation证实G-theory的\n      方差分量估计对model count的外推是可靠的，即使从3-model到4-model。\n      IRT/G-theory ratio在所有benchmark上落在3.5-4.2×范围，其中GSM8K最高是因为\n      reasoning tasks上prompt wording和random seed对specific items的影响更大\n      （chain-of-thought的variability），G-theory需要更多items来stabilize。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-003: Multi-Hardware Separability\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Multi-Hardware G-Study (Separability Crossing)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second type, e.g., A100-80GB) × 2 precisions\n      (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。\n      检验hardware×methodology separability——Claim 2的核心。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 1152000  # 4 models × 2 GPUs × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 ord × 200 items\n      gpu_types: [\"RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\", \"A100_80GB\"]\n\n      # --- Hardware-related variance components (binary scoring) ---\n      hardware_main_effect_pct: 0.02\n      hardware_x_item_pct: 0.31\n      hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.05\n      hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.03\n      hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.01\n      hardware_x_temperature_pct: 0.04\n      hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_binary_pct: 0.18\n      hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_text_pct: 0.72\n\n      # --- Comparison: single-GPU vs cross-GPU variance decomposition ---\n      cross_gpu_variance_pct:\n        item_id: 41.6\n        model: 4.7\n        model_x_item: 33.9\n        hardware: 0.02\n        hardware_x_item: 0.31\n        hardware_x_methodology: 0.18\n        prompt_template: 2.1\n        temperature: 2.7\n        seed: 0.5\n        precision: 0.01\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n        residual_and_other: 13.9\n\n      # --- Per-GPU accuracy comparison ---\n      accuracy_by_gpu:\n        RTX_PRO_6000_bf16: 0.6704\n        A100_80GB_bf16: 0.6698\n        accuracy_delta_pp: 0.06\n\n      # --- Separability confirmed under binary ---\n      separability_binary_cross_gpu: 0.18\n      separability_text_cross_gpu: 0.72\n      separability_binary_threshold_met: true   # < 0.5%\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hardware×methodology interaction在binary scoring下仅0.18%，因为两个GPU的\n      computational difference（不同CUDA core architecture, 不同memory bandwidth）\n      在binary classification层面几乎不可观测：logit值的微小差异（由hardware-specific\n      floating-point implementation引起）极少跨越0/1 classification boundary。\n      Hardware main effect仅0.02%因为两个GPU运行相同的vLLM inference stack，\n      model weights相同，只有底层compute kernel的numerical differences。\n      Hardware×item=0.31%略高于hardware×methodology，因为某些items的logit margin\n      较小（borderline items），在不同GPU上更容易flip——但这仍然极小。\n      \n      Text-exact-match下hardware×methodology升至0.72%（仍<1%但比binary高4×），\n      因为text generation的autoregressive decoding中floating-point non-associativity\n      在不同GPU architecture上有不同的error accumulation pattern，影响生成的\n      exact string。但binary scoring完全mask了这种差异。\n      \n      Cross-GPU后整体variance structure几乎不变（item_id 42.1→41.6%, model×item \n      33.6→33.9%），因为hardware facet只从residual中解释了<0.5%的variance。\n      这confirms separability：infrastructure和methodology的effects可以独立研究。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Hardware × Methodology Interaction Terms (Binary vs Text Scoring)\"\n        rows:\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×prompt\", binary_pct: 0.03, text_pct: 0.18}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×seed\", binary_pct: 0.01, text_pct: 0.08}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×temperature\", binary_pct: 0.04, text_pct: 0.22}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×precision\", binary_pct: 0.05, text_pct: 0.14}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×ordering\", binary_pct: 0.01, text_pct: 0.05}\n          - {interaction: \"aggregate hardware×methodology\", binary_pct: 0.18, text_pct: 0.72}\n      - name: \"Table 9: Single-GPU vs Cross-GPU Variance Decomposition Stability\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", single_gpu_pct: 42.1, cross_gpu_pct: 41.6, delta: -0.5}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", single_gpu_pct: 33.6, cross_gpu_pct: 33.9, delta: 0.3}\n          - {source: \"hardware (new)\", single_gpu_pct: \"—\", cross_gpu_pct: 0.02, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"hardware×item (new)\", single_gpu_pct: \"—\", cross_gpu_pct: 0.31, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"hardware×methodology (new)\", single_gpu_pct: \"—\", cross_gpu_pct: 0.18, delta: \"—\"}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary Figure: 两列stacked-bar（RTX PRO 6000 vs A100），各benchmark\n        的variance decomposition几乎视觉identical，hardware-related components用\n        虚线outline标注但因太小几乎不可见。配inset放大图展示hardware×methodology\n        interaction在binary（0.18%）vs text（0.72%）下的差异。\n\n    analysis: >\n      Separability在binary scoring下通过两个independent GPU architecture confirmed\n      （0.18% < 0.5% threshold），直接支持Claim 2。这意味着prior isolated-factor \n      studies（如Yuan et al. 2025只研究hardware，Brittlebench只研究prompt）的\n      结论在aggregate level上可以合法组合——infrastructure和methodology的effects不\n      interact。但metric qualification仍然critical：text scoring下interaction升至\n      0.72%，虽仍<1%但已非negligible。Hardware×item的0.31%提示separability是\n      conditional on aggregation level——at the item level, hardware effects are \n      item-specific，practitioners不能假设\"换GPU对所有items影响一样\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-004: Comprehensive Analysis Suite\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      对exp-001/001b/002/003的combined data执行17项分析：\n      (a) model-as-facet, (b) bootstrap CIs, (c) D-study projections, \n      (d) REML comparison, (e) logprob scoring, (f) ranking stability, \n      (g) higher-order interactions, (h) IRT comparison, (i) power analysis,\n      (j) practitioner guide, (k) fixed vs random sensitivity, (l) binary data analysis,\n      (m) bootstrap vs jackknife, (n) design asymmetry, (o) full-scale projection,\n      (p) logprob all benchmarks, (q) GPU cost。\n      Pure analysis — no GPU compute needed。\n\n    expected_results:\n      # (a) Model-as-facet — already reflected in exp-001 cross-model results\n      model_as_facet_confirmed: true\n\n      # (b) Bootstrap CIs (1000 resamples, all experiments)\n      bootstrap_CI_widths:\n        MMLU_item_id: [36.0, 48.8]\n        MMLU_model_x_item: [28.4, 37.9]\n        MMLU_G_item: [0.782, 0.861]\n        HellaSwag_item_id: [30.1, 42.8]\n        ARC_item_id: [22.4, 35.2]\n        GSM8K_item_id: [16.2, 29.1]\n        GSM8K_model_x_item: [39.8, 53.7]\n\n      # (c) D-study benchmark-specific budgets (items × prompts × seeds for target G)\n      d_study_budgets_G80:\n        MMLU: {items: 414, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, ordering: 2, note: \"practical (prec+temp fixed)\"}\n        HellaSwag: {items: 445, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, ordering: 2}\n        ARC: {items: 498, prompts: 4, seeds: 3, ordering: 2}\n        GSM8K: {items: 588, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, ordering: 2}\n      d_study_budgets_G90:\n        MMLU: {items: 820, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, ordering: 3}\n        HellaSwag: {items: 880, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, ordering: 3}\n        ARC: {items: 985, prompts: 5, seeds: 4, ordering: 3}\n        GSM8K: {items: 1180, prompts: 5, seeds: 5, ordering: 3}\n\n      # (d) REML vs Henderson I (all experiments)\n      reml_henderson_max_diff_all_experiments_pp: 0.48\n      reml_confirms_henderson: true\n\n      # (e) Logprob scoring (third metric)\n      logprob_variance_MMLU:\n        item_id: 55.2\n        model_x_item: 28.4\n        prompt_template: 3.8\n        temperature: 0.1   # logprob less temp-sensitive than binary\n        residual_and_other: 12.5\n      logprob_G_200items: 0.584\n      logprob_note: \"Intermediate between binary (0.611) and text-exact (0.007)\"\n\n      # (f) Ranking stability — precision×temperature interaction effect on model rankings\n      ranking_stability:\n        model_rank_changes_from_precision: 0    # no rank changes under binary\n        model_rank_changes_from_temperature: 1  # Mistral/Qwen swap at T=0.7\n        rank_stability_conclusion: \"Model rankings robust to precision; temperature affects only the closest pair\"\n\n      # (g) Higher-order interaction decomposition of residual\n      residual_decomposition:\n        original_residual_pct: 19.5   # from cross-model\n        three_way_interactions_pct: 6.2\n        four_way_and_higher_pct: 2.1\n        true_residual_pct: 11.2\n        note: \"3-way interactions (model×prompt×item, model×seed×item) account for ~6% — model-conditional methodological sensitivity\"\n\n      # (h) IRT vs G-theory direct comparison\n      irt_comparison:\n        MMLU_IRT_items_G80: 116\n        MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80: 510      # all random\n        MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80_practical: 414\n        ratio_all_random: 4.40\n        ratio_practical: 3.57\n        at_IRT_116_items_Gtheory_G: 0.529\n        difference_attribution: \"prompt×item (4.6%), seed×item (4.7%), ordering×item (1.2%), and residual (21.6%) — dimensions IRT ignores\"\n        cross_benchmark_ratios: {MMLU: 4.40, HellaSwag: 3.77, ARC: 3.61, GSM8K: 4.14}\n        all_ratios_in_3_5_range: true\n\n      # (i) Power analysis\n      power_analysis:\n        design_size_conditions_x_items: \"5184 × 200\"\n        power_to_detect_2pct_interaction: 0.97\n        power_to_detect_1pct_interaction: 0.88\n        power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction: 0.72\n        conclusion: \">95% power for ≥2% effects, adequate for all claimed interactions\"\n\n      # (k) Fixed vs random sensitivity\n      fixed_vs_random:\n        temperature_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 1.8\n        ordering_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 0.4\n        both_fixed_G_range: [0.611, 0.664]\n        max_change_pct: 2.2\n        conclusion: \"All decompositions within <3% — robust to facet classification\"\n\n      # (l) Binary data Bernoulli analysis\n      binary_data:\n        bernoulli_p1p_correlation_with_item_variance: 0.42\n        null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.08\n        observed_to_null_ratio: 737.5\n        conclusion: \"Bernoulli linkage moderate (r=0.42) but item_id signal 737× null — binary artifact negligible\"\n\n      # (m) Bootstrap vs jackknife CI comparison\n      bootstrap_vs_jackknife:\n        CI_width_ratio_range: [0.94, 1.06]\n        mean_ratio: 1.00\n        conclusion: \"Independence violation from bootstrap negligible — jackknife confirms\"\n\n      # (n) Design asymmetry sensitivity (MMLU 3×3 vs matched 2×2)\n      design_asymmetry:\n        MMLU_3x3_item_id: 42.1\n        MMLU_2x2_item_id: 41.8\n        delta_pp: 0.3\n        max_component_delta_pp: 0.8\n        conclusion: \"Reduced design introduces <1pp bias on any component\"\n\n      # (o) Full-benchmark D-study projection\n      full_benchmark_projection:\n        MMLU_14K_items_G: 0.982\n        MMLU_14K_note: \"Standard MMLU with ~14K items is highly reliable even under G-theory\"\n        GSM8K_1319_items_G: 0.924\n        ARC_2590_items_G: 0.961\n\n      # (p) Logprob scoring across all benchmarks\n      logprob_cross_benchmark:\n        MMLU_logprob_item_id: 55.2\n        HellaSwag_logprob_item_id: 49.8\n        ARC_logprob_item_id: 40.1\n        GSM8K_logprob_item_id: 32.6\n        gradient_preserved: true\n        note: \"Logprob shows same monotonic gradient as binary, with higher item_id across all benchmarks (logprob is more item-sensitive)\"\n\n      # (q) GPU cost analysis\n      gpu_cost:\n        total_experiment_gpu_hours: 485\n        recommended_budget_single_benchmark_gpu_hours: 35\n        recommended_budget_4_benchmarks_gpu_hours: 140\n        cost_at_cloud_rate_per_hour_USD: 2.50\n        total_cost_single_benchmark_USD: 87.50\n        total_cost_4_benchmarks_USD: 350\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      (b) Bootstrap CIs: MMLU item_id CI [36.0, 48.8]宽度12.8pp因为200 items的\n      item-level resampling creates substantial variability，但CI不包含0且\n      item_id始终是largest component——qualitative conclusion robust。\n      \n      (e) Logprob scoring: item_id=55.2%比binary（42.1%）高因为logprob是continuous measure，\n      item difficulty的granularity更高（不只是pass/fail），temperature的影响几乎消失\n      （0.1%）因为logprob是在temperature sampling之前计算的。G=0.584比binary低因为\n      logprob的额外variance来自model×item interaction的finer-grained structure。\n      \n      (g) Higher-order interactions: 3-way interactions占6.2%主要是model×prompt×item\n      和model×seed×item——说明模型对prompt phrasing和random seed的sensitivity也是\n      item-specific的，这进一步强化了\"no universal recipe\"的narrative。\n      \n      (h) IRT ratio: 3.57-4.40×因为IRT把prompt/seed/ordering的effects全部归入\n      residual noise，而G-theory显式建模这些facets。在IRT推荐的116 items处G-theory G\n      仅0.529——意味着如果practitioner只听从IRT建议而忽略facet effects，实际reliability\n      比预期低很多。Cross-benchmark ratio在[3.5, 4.4]范围内变化，因为不同benchmark上\n      prompt×item和seed×item的relative importance不同。\n      \n      (i) Power: >95% power for ≥2% effects因为930,400 records的design scale极大，\n      即使是small interaction terms也能可靠检测。\n      \n      (n) Design asymmetry: MMLU 3×3 vs 2×2仅差0.3pp因为额外的temperature level (T=0.3)\n      和precision level (FP32)主要增加了main effects的estimation precision而非改变\n      relative decomposition结构。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: D-Study Budget Calculator (Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target G)\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", G_target: 0.80, items: 414, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 36}\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", G_target: 0.90, items: 820, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, orderings: 3, total_conditions: 96}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", G_target: 0.80, items: 445, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 36}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", G_target: 0.80, items: 498, prompts: 4, seeds: 3, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 48}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", G_target: 0.80, items: 588, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 64}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", G_target: 0.90, items: 1180, prompts: 5, seeds: 5, orderings: 3, total_conditions: 150}\n      - name: \"Table 11: IRT vs G-Theory Item Requirements Across Benchmarks\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", IRT_items: 116, Gtheory_items_all_random: 510, Gtheory_practical: 414, ratio_practical: 3.57, G_at_IRT_items: 0.529}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", IRT_items: 118, Gtheory_items_all_random: 480, Gtheory_practical: 445, ratio_practical: 3.77, G_at_IRT_items: 0.518}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", IRT_items: 138, Gtheory_items_all_random: 540, Gtheory_practical: 498, ratio_practical: 3.61, G_at_IRT_items: 0.492}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", IRT_items: 142, Gtheory_items_all_random: 610, Gtheory_practical: 588, ratio_practical: 4.14, G_at_IRT_items: 0.461}\n      - name: \"Table 12: Bootstrap CIs on Key Variance Components (All Benchmarks)\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", item_id_CI: \"[36.0, 48.8]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[28.4, 37.9]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.782, 0.861]\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", item_id_CI: \"[30.1, 42.8]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[30.2, 41.6]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.774, 0.855]\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", item_id_CI: \"[22.4, 35.2]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[34.1, 47.0]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.756, 0.839]\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", item_id_CI: \"[16.2, 29.1]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[39.8, 53.7]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.741, 0.828]\"}\n      - name: \"Table 13: Fixed vs Random Facet Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        rows:\n          - {scenario: \"All random (baseline)\", item_id: 42.1, model_x_item: 33.6, G: 0.611}\n          - {scenario: \"Temperature fixed\", item_id: 43.9, model_x_item: 33.8, G: 0.638}\n          - {scenario: \"Ordering fixed\", item_id: 42.5, model_x_item: 33.7, G: 0.618}\n          - {scenario: \"Both fixed\", item_id: 44.1, model_x_item: 34.0, G: 0.664}\n          - {scenario: \"Max Δ from baseline\", item_id: 2.0, model_x_item: 0.4, G: 0.053}\n      - name: \"Table 14: Binary Data Validation — Observed vs Null Simulation\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"item_id (%)\", observed: 61.1, null_simulation: 0.08, ratio: 737.5}\n          - {metric: \"Bernoulli p(1-p) correlation\", value: 0.42, interpretation: \"moderate linkage — 42% of item variance covaries with Bernoulli bound\"}\n          - {metric: \"Items where obs > 2×Bernoulli\", count: 172, pct_of_200: 86.0}\n      - name: \"Table 15: Logprob Variance Decomposition Across Benchmarks\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", item_id: 55.2, model_x_item: 28.4, prompt: 3.8, temperature: 0.1, G: 0.584}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", item_id: 49.8, model_x_item: 31.2, prompt: 4.1, temperature: 0.08, G: 0.562}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", item_id: 40.1, model_x_item: 36.8, prompt: 4.5, temperature: 0.12, G: 0.531}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", item_id: 32.6, model_x_item: 42.1, prompt: 4.2, temperature: 0.15, G: 0.498}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 3 (D-study projection curves): 4条曲线（每benchmark一条），x轴=item count\n        （50–1200），y轴=G coefficient。水平虚线标注G=0.80和G=0.90 thresholds。\n        MMLU最先到达G=0.80（414 items），GSM8K最迟（588 items）。每条曲线有shaded \n        bootstrap CI band。右侧小图展示practical vs all-random allocation的差异。\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): paired bar chart × 4 benchmarks。每pair左=IRT\n        （短bar, 116–142 items），右=G-theory（长bar, 414–588 items）。\n        Gap区域用分解条纹填充：prompt×item（蓝条纹）、seed×item（绿条纹）、\n        ordering×item（橙条纹）、residual（灰条纹），直观展示\"extra items的去向\"。\n        顶部标注ratio（3.6×–4.1×）。\n      - >\n        Figure 5 (Temperature-stratified G heatmap): 3×3 grid（或4×3），行=benchmark，\n        列=temperature（T=0.0, T=0.3, T=0.7）。每个cell颜色=G value，深绿=高G,\n        深红=低G。Binary scoring行从浅绿（G=0.76 at T=0.0）渐变到黄（G=0.55 at T=0.7）。\n        Text-exact-match行全部深红（G<0.01 for T>0）。Logprob行介于两者之间。\n\n    analysis: >\n      17项sub-analysis形成完整的methodological defense package。最关键的发现：\n      (1) IRT比较直接量化了\"忽略multi-facet reliability的hidden cost\"——在IRT推荐的\n      116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529（远低于0.80），这不是IRT\"错了\"而是它回答的是\n      不同的问题（item-only reliability vs multi-facet reliability）。\n      (2) 3-way interactions占6.2%说明even prompt sensitivity是model×item conditional的，\n      进一步巩固了\"no universal recipe\"。(3) Logprob gradient preserved意味着\n      cross-benchmark finding不是binary scoring artifact。(4) Power>95% for ≥2% effects\n      preempts underpowered concern。(5) Full-benchmark projection（MMLU 14K→G=0.982）\n      防止了\"MMLU is unreliable\"的misinterpretation。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-005: 14B Model Scale Extension\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"14B Model Scale Extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-14B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B on datacenter GPU at BF16/FP16。\n      MMLU 200 items × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings。\n      检验variance structure是否随model scale变化。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 345600   # 2 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 ord × 200 items\n      accuracy_Qwen3_14B_bf16: 0.782\n      accuracy_DeepSeek_R1_14B_bf16: 0.758\n\n      # --- Variance decomposition (2-model crossing, bf16) ---\n      variance_14B:\n        item_id: 40.8\n        model: 3.2\n        model_x_item: 35.2\n        prompt_template: 2.5\n        temperature: 3.0\n        seed: 0.4\n        precision: 0.008\n        residual_and_other: 14.9\n\n      # --- Comparison with 7-9B ---\n      comparison_with_7_9B:\n        item_id_delta_pp: -1.3    # 42.1 → 40.8\n        model_x_item_delta_pp: 1.6  # 33.6 → 35.2\n        within_bootstrap_CI: true\n        hierarchy_preserved: true\n\n      G_item_14B: 0.808\n      G_item_7_9B: 0.820\n      G_item_delta: 0.012\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B模型的variance structure与7-9B非常接近（item_id Δ=-1.3pp, model×item Δ=+1.6pp，\n      均在bootstrap CI内），因为variance decomposition反映的是evaluation design的\n      structural properties（item difficulty distribution, prompt variation space），\n      而非model capacity per se。14B的model×item略高（35.2% vs 33.6%）因为\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled architecture对items有更distinctive的\n      interaction pattern（某些需要chain-of-thought的items上远优于Qwen3-14B，\n      但在simple retrieval items上差异消失）。G_item从0.820略降至0.808因为只有2个\n      models的crossing，估计精度更低——但仍>0.80。这个结果说明variance hierarchy\n      是evaluation design的property而非model scale的function，支持findings的\n      generalizability beyond specific model sizes。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 14B vs 7-9B Variance Structure Comparison (MMLU)\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", \"7-9B_4models\": 42.1, \"14B_2models\": 40.8, delta: -1.3, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", \"7-9B_4models\": 33.6, \"14B_2models\": 35.2, delta: 1.6, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"model\", \"7-9B_4models\": 4.8, \"14B_2models\": 3.2, delta: -1.6, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"prompt\", \"7-9B_4models\": 2.1, \"14B_2models\": 2.5, delta: 0.4, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"precision\", \"7-9B_4models\": 0.3, \"14B_2models\": 0.008, delta: -0.29, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary Figure: side-by-side stacked-bars（7-9B vs 14B），\n        视觉上几乎identical，标注\"scale-invariant variance structure\"。\n        Precision component在14B上几乎invisible（0.008%），因为14B at bf16精度已极高。\n\n    analysis: >\n      14B extension confirms variance hierarchy is scale-invariant for the studied range。\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled nature导致了slightly higher model×item\n      （architecture-specific item sensitivity），但qualitative结论unchanged。\n      Precision effect在14B上更小（0.008%）因为higher accuracy models的logit margins\n      更大，precision-induced perturbations更不可能flip classifications。\n      此结果可在Discussion中报告为generalizability evidence。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-006: Fine-Tuning G-Study (Discussion Observation)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。\n      6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task。\n      检验fine-tuning variance hierarchy是否与inference不同。\n      Downgraded to Discussion-section preliminary observation。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_runs: 1728  # 432 × 4 tasks\n      total_evaluation_records: 864000  # approximate, varies by test set size\n\n      # --- Variance decomposition by task ---\n      variance_SST2:\n        seed: 15.2\n        learning_rate: 22.8\n        data_shuffle: 8.1\n        gpu: 0.4\n        precision: 0.3\n        seed_x_lr: 12.6\n        seed_x_data: 5.8\n        gpu_x_precision: 0.5\n        residual: 34.3\n\n      variance_MNLI:\n        seed: 18.6\n        learning_rate: 25.1\n        data_shuffle: 10.4\n        gpu: 0.6\n        precision: 0.4\n        seed_x_lr: 11.2\n        seed_x_data: 6.5\n        gpu_x_precision: 0.8\n        residual: 26.4\n\n      variance_RTE:\n        seed: 38.2\n        learning_rate: 18.5\n        data_shuffle: 12.8\n        gpu: 0.9\n        precision: 0.7\n        seed_x_lr: 8.4\n        seed_x_data: 7.2\n        gpu_x_precision: 1.1\n        residual: 12.2\n\n      variance_COPA:\n        seed: 42.4\n        learning_rate: 14.8\n        data_shuffle: 14.2\n        gpu: 1.0\n        precision: 0.8\n        seed_x_lr: 7.6\n        seed_x_data: 8.1\n        gpu_x_precision: 1.5\n        residual: 9.6\n\n      # --- Key insight ---\n      seed_dominance_range_pct: [15.2, 42.4]\n      seed_dominance_inversely_correlated_with_dataset_size: true\n      gpu_x_precision_max_pct: 1.5\n      variance_hierarchy_differs_from_inference: true\n      inference_dominant: \"item_id\"\n      finetuning_dominant: \"seed\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fine-tuning的variance hierarchy fundamentally不同于inference：seed（15-42%）取代\n      item_id成为dominant source，因为random initialization + data order创建了不同的\n      loss landscape trajectories。RTE和COPA上seed占比极高（38-42%）因为dataset tiny\n      （RTE ~277 examples, COPA 100 examples），few training examples mean each random \n      seed leads to a very different local minimum。SST-2上seed较低（15%）因为dataset \n      large（67K），optimization landscape更smooth。Learning rate是second largest \n      （15-25%）因为它直接控制optimization trajectory。GPU×precision较小（0.5-1.5%）\n      但比inference高（inference <0.1%），因为fine-tuning中gradient computation的\n      floating-point差异会accumulate across thousands of training steps。\n      \n      这个结果支持论文的narrative：variance structure是conditional on evaluation \n      paradigm的——not just benchmark-conditional, but fundamentally different between \n      inference and fine-tuning。但作为encoder-only model on classification tasks，\n      不能直接generalize to decoder fine-tuning。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 17: Fine-Tuning Variance Decomposition (RoBERTa-large, 4 Tasks)\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"seed\", SST2: 15.2, MNLI: 18.6, RTE: 38.2, COPA: 42.4, trend: \"↑ with smaller dataset\"}\n          - {source: \"learning_rate\", SST2: 22.8, MNLI: 25.1, RTE: 18.5, COPA: 14.8, trend: \"↓ with smaller dataset\"}\n          - {source: \"data_shuffle\", SST2: 8.1, MNLI: 10.4, RTE: 12.8, COPA: 14.2, trend: \"↑ with smaller dataset\"}\n          - {source: \"gpu×precision\", SST2: 0.5, MNLI: 0.8, RTE: 1.1, COPA: 1.5, trend: \"↑ slight\"}\n          - {source: \"seed×lr\", SST2: 12.6, MNLI: 11.2, RTE: 8.4, COPA: 7.6, trend: \"↓\"}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary Figure (Discussion): stacked-bar对比 inference (MMLU, item_id dominant)\n        vs fine-tuning (RTE, seed dominant)，突出两种evaluation paradigm的variance hierarchy\n        qualitatively不同。用双色对比：inference bar以蓝(item)为主，fine-tuning bar以紫(seed)为主。\n\n    analysis: >\n      Fine-tuning G-study confirms the hypothesis that variance hierarchy is paradigm-dependent。\n      Seed dominance scales inversely with dataset size（r=-0.94 across 4 tasks），\n      consistent with Bui et al. (2025) who reported extreme seed sensitivity in \n      RoBERTa on COPA (RTES variance=18.22)。GPU×precision虽小但比inference高一个\n      数量级，因为gradient accumulation across training steps amplifies hardware-level \n      numerical differences。Explicitly qualified: RoBERTa is encoder-only on \n      classification tasks — decoder fine-tuning may differ due to autoregressive \n      generation during evaluation。This observation goes in Discussion section only。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-007: LayerCast Precision Mitigation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LayerCast Precision Mitigation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as additional precision condition on MMLU。\n      Llama-3.1-8B × 3 conditions (BF16, FP16, LayerCast) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds \n      × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 129600  # 1 model × 3 conditions × 6×6×3×4 = 432 cond × 200 items... wait let me recalculate\n      # Actually: 3 precision conditions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings = 1296 conditions × 200 items = 259,200 records\n      total_records_corrected: 259200\n\n      accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n      accuracy_fp16: 0.711\n      accuracy_layercast: 0.712\n\n      # --- Variance with LayerCast included ---\n      precision_effect_3cond_pct: 0.0004\n      precision_x_item_3cond_pct: 0.02\n      layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.10\n      layercast_vs_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.08\n\n      # --- Comparison ---\n      precision_effect_without_layercast: 0.0006\n      precision_effect_with_layercast: 0.0004\n      variance_reduction_factor: 1.5\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      LayerCast进一步压缩了已经极小的precision effect（0.0006→0.0004%），因为FP32 \n      compute消除了FP16 storage中的rare precision loss events。但改善极其marginal，\n      因为BF16和FP16之间的差异已经negligible（Δ=0.23pp accuracy），LayerCast只是\n      消除了这0.23pp中的一小部分。精度from storage→compute pipeline是完全可逆的——\n      FP16→FP32 upcast在compute时恢复了full precision，但BF16→FP32的information\n      已经在storage时丢失了，所以LayerCast主要帮助FP16 path。\n      实际价值有限：best tier下BF16已经sufficiently precise，LayerCast是一个\n      minor optimization而非necessary mitigation。适合在Appendix中brief mention。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 18: LayerCast Precision Effect\"\n        rows:\n          - {condition: \"BF16 only\", accuracy: 0.711, precision_effect_pct: \"—\"}\n          - {condition: \"FP16 only\", accuracy: 0.711, precision_effect_pct: \"—\"}\n          - {condition: \"LayerCast\", accuracy: 0.712, precision_effect_pct: \"—\"}\n          - {condition: \"BF16 vs FP16\", delta_pp: 0.23, precision_var_pct: 0.0006}\n          - {condition: \"BF16 vs FP16 vs LayerCast\", delta_pp: 0.10, precision_var_pct: 0.0004}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix figure: 3条bar（BF16, FP16, LayerCast）的accuracy with error bars，差异不可见。Inset放大precision×item component在三种条件下的变化。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      LayerCast的marginal benefit confirms BF16/FP16已sufficient for reproducible \n      LLM evaluation。P2 priority justified——这个finding最多值一段appendix text。\n      但对于use cases where even 0.0006% matters（e.g., certification/compliance），\n      LayerCast提供了一个documented mitigation path。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-008: MATH Benchmark Extension\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"MATH Benchmark (Reasoning-Heavy Extension)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings \n      × 200 MATH items。检验reasoning-heavy tasks上的variance structure，\n      特别是chain-of-thought引入的additional variance。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 153600\n      accuracy_by_model:\n        Llama: 0.312\n        Gemma: 0.348\n        Mistral: 0.245\n        Qwen: 0.402\n\n      # --- Cross-model variance decomposition (binary scoring) ---\n      variance_MATH:\n        item_id: 18.1\n        model: 16.8\n        model_x_item: 50.8\n        prompt_template: 2.4\n        seed: 1.8\n        temperature: 1.2\n        precision: 0.03\n        prompt_x_item: 2.1\n        seed_x_item: 2.3\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.12\n        residual_and_other: 4.4\n\n      G_item_MATH: 0.781\n\n      # --- Gradient extension (5 benchmarks) ---\n      extended_gradient_item_id:\n        MMLU: 42.1\n        HellaSwag: 36.2\n        ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n        GSM8K: 22.4\n        MATH: 18.1\n      extended_gradient_range_pp: 24.0\n      extended_gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      extended_gradient_model_x_item:\n        MMLU: 33.6\n        HellaSwag: 35.8\n        ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n        GSM8K: 46.5\n        MATH: 50.8\n      inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      # --- D-study ---\n      d_study_MATH_items_G80_practical: 648\n      d_study_MATH_3to4_delta: 0.008\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_MATH: 4.56\n\n      # --- Separability ---\n      separability_binary_MATH: 0.12\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      MATH是gradient的natural endpoint：item_id仅18.1%因为数学问题的difficulty\n      极度model-specific——一道number theory题对数学强的模型trivial，对弱模型impossible，\n      这种all-or-nothing pattern使\"universal difficulty\"几乎不存在。Model×item达50.8%\n      （超过一半的variance），因为每个模型有fundamentally不同的mathematical reasoning \n      capabilities：Qwen在algebra强（可能因为训练数据中中文数学教材丰富），Gemma在\n      geometry好，Mistral整体最弱但在某些combinatorics问题上有unique strengths。\n      \n      Model main effect高达16.8%（vs MMLU 4.8%）因为MATH上模型间的overall accuracy \n      spread极大（Mistral 24.5% vs Qwen 40.2%，gap 15.7pp vs MMLU ~10pp）。\n      \n      Seed占1.8%（比MMLU高）因为chain-of-thought generation的randomness在multi-step\n      reasoning中有更多opportunity to diverge——一步走错全盘皆输。同理prompt的\n      绝对值虽相似（2.4%）但在剩余variance中的相对share更低。\n      \n      Residual仅4.4%——MATH上大部分variance都可以被identified sources解释，因为\n      binary correctness在math上更deterministic（答案对就是对，不像MMLU可能有\n      arguable answers）。\n      \n      G_item=0.781刚好在best tier threshold（≥0.78）内，因为even though model×item\n      dominates，4个模型仍然agree on some items being universally hard（e.g., \n      competition-level problems）或universally easy（e.g., basic arithmetic with \n      chain-of-thought support）。\n      \n      IRT/G-theory ratio 4.56×是最高的，因为MATH上seed×item（2.3%）和prompt×item（2.1%）\n      在low-item_id context中占relative importance更大。D-study需要648 items for G≥0.80，\n      远超MMLU的414——reasoning benchmarks上reliable evaluation更expensive。\n      \n      Extended gradient（24pp range, 5 benchmarks, perfect monotonicity）是best tier的\n      crown jewel：从MMLU到MATH，item dominance从42%降到18%，model×item从34%升到51%，\n      完美的mirror image。这直接说明\"universal reproducibility recipe\"是illusory——\n      在MMLU上\"多加items\"是最effective intervention，在MATH上\"多加models\"更重要。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 19: Extended 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient\"\n        columns: [source, MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC, GSM8K, MATH, trend]\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", MMLU: 42.1, HellaSwag: 36.2, ARC: 28.5, GSM8K: 22.4, MATH: 18.1, trend: \"↓ monotonic (Δ=24pp)\"}\n          - {source: \"model\", MMLU: 4.8, HellaSwag: 7.4, ARC: 10.6, GSM8K: 14.8, MATH: 16.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", MMLU: 33.6, HellaSwag: 35.8, ARC: 40.3, GSM8K: 46.5, MATH: 50.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"seed\", MMLU: 0.5, HellaSwag: 0.6, ARC: 0.8, GSM8K: 1.3, MATH: 1.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"precision×method\", MMLU: 0.03, HellaSwag: 0.08, ARC: 0.11, GSM8K: 0.14, MATH: 0.12, trend: \"≈0 all\"}\n          - {source: \"residual\", MMLU: 7.8, HellaSwag: 7.1, ARC: 6.7, GSM8K: 5.0, MATH: 4.4, trend: \"↓ monotonic\"}\n      - name: \"Table 20: MATH D-Study Budget\"\n        rows:\n          - {G_target: 0.80, items: 648, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 64}\n          - {G_target: 0.90, items: 1320, prompts: 5, seeds: 5, orderings: 3, total_conditions: 150}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 extended to 5 panels (if MATH included in paper scope): \n        MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K→MATH的stacked-bar gradient。\n        蓝色(item_id)从42%到18%系统性缩小，红色(model×item)从34%到51%系统性增大，\n        形成完美的X-pattern。这是整篇论文最powerful的visual。\n      - >\n        Supplementary scatter: x轴=benchmark reasoning complexity (ordinal 1-5),\n        y轴=variance percentage。item_id和model×item两条线呈X形交叉，\n        交叉点大约在ARC-Challenge处（≈29% vs ≈40%），annotated with\n        \"item_id = model×item crossover ≈ science reasoning level\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16375,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16375},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"801973e0-9633-495e-bb39-d573a59a3496","uuid":"f1419ac5-4836-405b-8640-d35521dae44c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":572575,"duration_api_ms":574062,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing完全成立。Cross-benchmark gradient是primary novel finding——\n  item_id从MMLU 42.1%单调递减至GSM8K 22.4%（Δ=19.7pp），model×item从33.6%\n  单调递增至46.5%。知识检索→多步推理的variance structure发生质变，item dominance\n  系统性减弱而model×item上升，直接解释了文献中关于\"item重要还是prompt重要\"的\n  矛盾结论——答案是benchmark-conditional。所有robustness分析hold：item resampling\n  CV=3.2%，leave-one-model-out G_item spread=0.023，BF16≈FP16（Δ<0.001%），\n  hardware×methodology<0.18%（binary）跨GPU confirmed。D-study在4个benchmark\n  上out-of-sample验证Δ≤0.007。IRT/G-theory ratio 3.5–4.4×在所有benchmark成立，\n  因为G-theory显式建模prompt×item、seed×item等IRT忽略的维度。Separability在binary\n  scoring下跨benchmark、跨GPU均<0.5%。5个figure全部有实质数据。Hook直接用：\n  \"no universal reproducibility recipe\"。AAAI 2027 strong accept范围（7–8/10），\n  三个claim均有充分empirical support，无需削弱任何主张。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-001: MMLU Full-Scale 4-Model G-Study\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"MMLU Full-Scale 4-Model G-Study\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      4 models (Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B, Qwen3-8B) × 3 precisions\n      (FP32/BF16/FP16; Gemma BF16+FP32 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n      × 4 orderings × 200 stratified MMLU items。V0 enforce_eager统一engine消除\n      FP32 confound。Henderson I + REML-EM(500 iter)双估计。Cross-model分析将\n      model作为crossed random facet。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 930400\n      records_per_model: {Llama: 239200, Gemma: 172800, Mistral: 259200, Qwen: 259200}\n      overall_accuracy_bf16: {Llama: 0.711, Gemma: 0.732, Mistral: 0.638, Qwen: 0.726}\n\n      # --- Single-model G-study (averaged across 4 models, binary scoring) ---\n      single_model_variance_pct:\n        item_id: 61.1\n        temperature: 4.1\n        prompt_template: 3.2\n        seed: 0.7\n        ordering: 0.3\n        precision: 0.4\n        prompt_x_item: 4.6\n        seed_x_item: 4.7\n        temperature_x_item: 2.8\n        precision_x_item: 1.3\n        precision_x_temperature: 0.06   # binary, near-zero\n        other_2way: 0.9\n        residual: 15.8\n      single_model_G_200items: 0.611\n\n      # --- Cross-model G-study (model as crossed random facet, balanced bf16) ---\n      cross_model_variance_pct:\n        item_id: 42.1\n        model: 4.8\n        model_x_item: 33.6\n        prompt_template: 2.1\n        temperature: 2.8\n        seed: 0.5\n        ordering: 0.2\n        precision: 0.3\n        prompt_x_item: 3.1\n        seed_x_item: 3.2\n        temperature_x_item: 1.8\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.04\n        residual_and_higher_order: 5.4\n      cross_model_G_item: 0.820\n      cross_model_G_item_CI: [0.782, 0.861]\n\n      # --- Per-model interaction magnitude ---\n      per_model_interaction_pct:\n        Mistral: 29.25   # lowest accuracy → highest interaction\n        Qwen: 27.11\n        Gemma: 23.95\n        Llama: 19.69     # item difficulty most \"universal\" for Llama\n\n      # --- D-study validation ---\n      d_study_3model_predicted_G4: 0.816\n      d_study_4model_actual_G: 0.820\n      d_study_delta: 0.004\n      d_study_forward_projections:\n        models_5: 0.848\n        models_8: 0.893\n        models_10: 0.910\n\n      # --- BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity (excluding FP32) ---\n      bf16_fp16_precision_effect_pct: 0.0006\n      bf16_fp16_precision_x_item_pct: 0.04\n      bf16_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.23\n\n      # --- Leave-one-model-out stability ---\n      lomo_G_item_values: {drop_Llama: 0.824, drop_Gemma: 0.808, drop_Mistral: 0.822, drop_Qwen: 0.801}\n      lomo_G_item_spread: 0.023\n      lomo_all_above_080: true\n      lomo_item_id_dominance_preserved: true\n\n      # --- REML vs Henderson I ---\n      reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 0.42\n      reml_convergence_iterations: 287\n      reml_practical_convergence_delta: 0.0018\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      item_id在single-model中占61.1%因为MMLU以factual knowledge为主，item难度\n      具有跨条件稳定性——一道关于细胞生物学的难题在任何prompt/seed下都难。引入model\n      facet后item_id降至42.1%（↓19pp），因为33.6%的variance被model×item吸收：\n      不同模型对同一item的难度排序不同（如Llama在历史题上强，Qwen在数学相关STEM题上强），\n      这部分\"model-conditional item difficulty\"在single-model分析中被错误归入item_id。\n      G_item=0.820表明4个模型的item difficulty排序moderately consistent但远非完美，\n      需要~10模型才能达到G≥0.90。D-study Δ=0.004是因为G-theory的D-study公式对\n      balanced designs有精确的方差分量线性组合形式，3-model估计已相当稳定。\n      BF16≈FP16（0.0006%）因为bf16和fp16的有效精度对logit差异的影响远小于\n      binary scoring的classification boundary margin。Leave-one-model-out spread=0.023\n      因为4个模型来自4个不同architecture family，每个都贡献了独特的item interaction\n      pattern——去掉任何一个都只轻微改变平均interaction结构。REML<0.5pp差异因为\n      balanced design下Henderson I是unbiased的。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Single-Model vs Cross-Model Variance Decomposition (MMLU)\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", single_model_pct: 61.1, cross_model_pct: 42.1, delta: -19.0}\n          - {source: \"model\", single_model_pct: \"—\", cross_model_pct: 4.8, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", single_model_pct: \"—\", cross_model_pct: 33.6, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"prompt_template\", single_model_pct: 3.2, cross_model_pct: 2.1, delta: -1.1}\n          - {source: \"temperature\", single_model_pct: 4.1, cross_model_pct: 2.8, delta: -1.3}\n          - {source: \"seed\", single_model_pct: 0.7, cross_model_pct: 0.5, delta: -0.2}\n          - {source: \"precision\", single_model_pct: 0.4, cross_model_pct: 0.3, delta: -0.1}\n          - {source: \"prompt×item\", single_model_pct: 4.6, cross_model_pct: 3.1, delta: -1.5}\n          - {source: \"seed×item\", single_model_pct: 4.7, cross_model_pct: 3.2, delta: -1.5}\n          - {source: \"residual+other\", single_model_pct: 21.2, cross_model_pct: 11.5, delta: -9.7}\n      - name: \"Table 2: Per-Model Interaction Magnitude\"\n        rows:\n          - {model: \"Mistral-7B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.638, model_x_item_pct: 29.25, rank: 1}\n          - {model: \"Qwen3-8B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.726, model_x_item_pct: 27.11, rank: 2}\n          - {model: \"Gemma-2-9B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.732, model_x_item_pct: 23.95, rank: 3}\n          - {model: \"Llama-3.1-8B\", accuracy_bf16: 0.711, model_x_item_pct: 19.69, rank: 4}\n      - name: \"Table 3: BF16 vs FP16 Sensitivity (FP32 Excluded)\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"precision main effect\", with_fp32_pct: 0.4, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.0006}\n          - {metric: \"precision×item\", with_fp32_pct: 1.3, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.04}\n          - {metric: \"precision×temperature (binary)\", with_fp32_pct: 0.06, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.003}\n          - {metric: \"accuracy Δ (pp)\", with_fp32_pct: 8.5, bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.23}\n      - name: \"Table 4: Leave-One-Model-Out G_item Stability\"\n        rows:\n          - {dropped_model: \"Llama\", remaining_G_item: 0.824, item_id_pct: 43.8, model_x_item_pct: 31.2}\n          - {dropped_model: \"Gemma\", remaining_G_item: 0.808, item_id_pct: 40.5, model_x_item_pct: 35.1}\n          - {dropped_model: \"Mistral\", remaining_G_item: 0.822, item_id_pct: 44.1, model_x_item_pct: 30.8}\n          - {dropped_model: \"Qwen\", remaining_G_item: 0.801, item_id_pct: 39.8, model_x_item_pct: 36.4}\n          - {dropped_model: \"None (full)\", remaining_G_item: 0.820, item_id_pct: 42.1, model_x_item_pct: 33.6}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 左半: MMLU stacked-bar对比图。左bar=single-model averaged（item_id 61.1%占主导，大块蓝色），右bar=cross-model（item_id缩至42.1%，model×item 33.6%以红色出现为second largest）。视觉上model×item从无到有的'reveal'效果。residual从21%→12%可见第四个model分裂了residual。\"\n      - \"Supplementary Figure: 4个leave-one-model-out子集的stacked-bar，展示variance结构在去掉任一模型后保持item_id dominance。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Henderson I用于primary estimation（balanced design unbiased），REML-EM(500 iter)\n      作为sensitivity check。两者最大差异0.42pp，确认balanced design下Henderson I\n      的可靠性。Cross-model分析使用balanced bf16 subset（所有4模型均支持bf16）。\n      BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity证实FP32异常完全来自vLLM enforce_eager artifact，\n      真实precision effect可忽略。Leave-one-model-out spread 0.023在合理范围，\n      所有子集保持item_id dominance且G_item>0.80，但drop_Qwen最低（0.801）\n      因为Qwen在STEM items上有独特的high-performance pattern，移除后减少了\n      item difficulty的cross-model agreement。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-001b: Item Resampling Stability\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Item Resampling Stability Test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001b\"\n    description: >\n      3 independent stratified draws of 200 MMLU items (seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama-3.1-8B\n      × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 10,800 records per draw。\n      检验headline claim是否依赖于特定200-item sample。\n\n    expected_results:\n      records_per_draw: 10800\n      total_records: 32400\n\n      # --- Variance decomposition per draw (single-model, binary) ---\n      draw_0_item_id_pct: 60.2\n      draw_7_item_id_pct: 62.4\n      draw_99_item_id_pct: 59.8\n      item_id_mean: 60.8\n      item_id_sd: 1.37\n      cv_item_id: 0.032\n\n      draw_0_precision_pct: 0.38\n      draw_7_precision_pct: 0.43\n      draw_99_precision_pct: 0.41\n      cv_precision: 0.061\n\n      draw_0_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.4\n      draw_7_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.9\n      draw_99_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.5\n      cv_prompt_x_item: 0.057\n\n      # --- G-coefficient per draw ---\n      draw_0_G: 0.604\n      draw_7_G: 0.622\n      draw_99_G: 0.609\n      G_mean: 0.612\n      G_sd: 0.009\n      cv_G: 0.015\n\n      # --- Accuracy per draw ---\n      draw_0_accuracy: 0.674\n      draw_7_accuracy: 0.689\n      draw_99_accuracy: 0.681\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      CV(item_id)=3.2%远低于5%阈值，因为200-item stratified sampling覆盖了MMLU的\n      57个subject categories，每个category至少3-4 items。Item difficulty的分布在\n      每次draw中都能充分代表MMLU的overall difficulty spectrum。即使specific items不同，\n      stratification确保了difficulty distribution的稳定性。G-coefficient的CV更低（1.5%），\n      因为G是所有方差分量的ratio，individual component的小波动在ratio中部分对消。\n      Draw 7略高（62.4%）因为随机抽到了更多difficulty极端的items（很难或很容易），\n      这些items的item_id方差贡献更大（Bernoulli p(1-p)在p=0.5时最大），\n      但差异在统计噪声范围内。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Item Resampling Stability (3 Draws × Key Metrics)\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"item_id (%)\", draw_0: 60.2, draw_7: 62.4, draw_99: 59.8, mean: 60.8, CV: 0.032}\n          - {metric: \"precision (%)\", draw_0: 0.38, draw_7: 0.43, draw_99: 0.41, mean: 0.41, CV: 0.061}\n          - {metric: \"prompt×item (%)\", draw_0: 4.4, draw_7: 4.9, draw_99: 4.5, mean: 4.6, CV: 0.057}\n          - {metric: \"seed×item (%)\", draw_0: 4.6, draw_7: 4.9, draw_99: 4.5, mean: 4.7, CV: 0.045}\n          - {metric: \"G (200 items)\", draw_0: 0.604, draw_7: 0.622, draw_99: 0.609, mean: 0.612, CV: 0.015}\n          - {metric: \"residual (%)\", draw_0: 16.2, draw_7: 15.1, draw_99: 16.8, mean: 16.0, CV: 0.054}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Supplementary Figure: 三组draw的variance decomposition stacked bar并排，视觉上几乎identical，配error bar显示component-level stability。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      三组draw的variance hierarchy完全一致（item_id >> seed×item ≈ prompt×item > temperature > \n      prompt > precision），CV均<6%。最关键的item_id CV=3.2%说明200-item stratified \n      sampling在MMLU上具有充分代表性。这为exp-002使用同样的200-item sampling策略\n      在其他benchmark上提供了方法论支撑。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-002: Multi-Benchmark Replication (Cross-Benchmark Gradient)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Multi-Benchmark Variance Gradient\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0, T=0.7) \n      × 4 orderings × 200 items each on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。\n      Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs MMLU's 3×3)。\n      检验cross-benchmark variance gradient——paper的primary novel finding。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records_per_benchmark: 153600   # 4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 ord × 200 items (Gemma bf16 only → adjusted)\n      total_records_all: 460800\n\n      # --- Overall accuracy by benchmark (bf16 average across 4 models) ---\n      accuracy_by_benchmark:\n        MMLU: 0.670\n        HellaSwag: 0.718\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.598\n        GSM8K: 0.485\n\n      # --- Cross-model variance decomposition (model as facet, binary scoring) ---\n      variance_MMLU_matched_2x2:   # re-analyzed with 2 prec × 2 temp to match\n        item_id: 41.8\n        model: 4.9\n        model_x_item: 34.0\n        prompt_template: 2.2\n        seed: 0.5\n        temperature: 2.6\n        precision: 0.02\n        prompt_x_item: 3.0\n        seed_x_item: 3.1\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n        residual_and_other: 7.8\n\n      variance_HellaSwag:\n        item_id: 36.2\n        model: 7.4\n        model_x_item: 35.8\n        prompt_template: 3.5\n        seed: 0.6\n        temperature: 3.1\n        precision: 0.03\n        prompt_x_item: 3.4\n        seed_x_item: 2.8\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.08\n        residual_and_other: 7.1\n\n      variance_ARC_Challenge:\n        item_id: 28.5\n        model: 10.6\n        model_x_item: 40.3\n        prompt_template: 4.2\n        seed: 0.8\n        temperature: 2.4\n        precision: 0.05\n        prompt_x_item: 3.8\n        seed_x_item: 2.5\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.11\n        residual_and_other: 6.7\n\n      variance_GSM8K:\n        item_id: 22.4\n        model: 14.8\n        model_x_item: 46.5\n        prompt_template: 3.9\n        seed: 1.3\n        temperature: 1.5\n        precision: 0.04\n        prompt_x_item: 2.6\n        seed_x_item: 1.8\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.14\n        residual_and_other: 5.0\n\n      # --- Gradient summary ---\n      cross_bench_item_id_gradient:\n        MMLU: 42.1\n        HellaSwag: 36.2\n        ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n        GSM8K: 22.4\n      gradient_range_pp: 19.7\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      cross_bench_model_x_item_gradient:\n        MMLU: 33.6\n        HellaSwag: 35.8\n        ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n        GSM8K: 46.5\n      inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      cross_bench_model_main_effect:\n        MMLU: 4.8\n        HellaSwag: 7.4\n        ARC_Challenge: 10.6\n        GSM8K: 14.8\n\n      # --- G_item per benchmark ---\n      G_item_by_benchmark:\n        MMLU: 0.820\n        HellaSwag: 0.812\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.795\n        GSM8K: 0.782\n      G_item_cross_bench_min: 0.782\n\n      # --- Separability per benchmark (binary scoring) ---\n      separability_binary_pct:\n        MMLU: 0.03\n        HellaSwag: 0.08\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.11\n        GSM8K: 0.14\n      separability_binary_max: 0.14\n\n      # --- D-study cross-benchmark validation ---\n      d_study_3to4_model_delta:\n        MMLU: 0.004\n        HellaSwag: 0.004\n        ARC_Challenge: 0.005\n        GSM8K: 0.007\n      d_study_max_delta: 0.007\n\n      # --- D-study budget (items for G≥0.80, practical: precision+temp fixed) ---\n      d_study_items_G80_practical:\n        MMLU: 414\n        HellaSwag: 445\n        ARC_Challenge: 498\n        GSM8K: 588\n\n      # --- IRT vs G-theory comparison ---\n      irt_items_G80:\n        MMLU: 116\n        HellaSwag: 118\n        ARC_Challenge: 138\n        GSM8K: 142\n      gtheory_over_irt_ratio:\n        MMLU: 3.57\n        HellaSwag: 3.77\n        ARC_Challenge: 3.61\n        GSM8K: 4.14\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-benchmark gradient的物理机制：MMLU是knowledge retrieval——item difficulty\n      主要由factual content的obscurity决定，这在模型间有较高consensus（都是同一个\n      training corpus的产物），所以item_id高（42.1%）。HellaSwag是commonsense \n      completion——需要world knowledge + contextual reasoning，model-specific strengths\n      开始分化（有的模型在physical reasoning强，有的在social reasoning强），item_id\n      降至36.2%。ARC-Challenge是science reasoning——需要multi-hop inference over \n      scientific concepts，不同模型的reasoning chain策略差异更大，model×item升至40.3%。\n      GSM8K是multi-step math——每道题需要2-8步arithmetic+word problem decomposition，\n      不同模型的mathematical reasoning能力差异极大且item-specific（某模型能做\n      ratio problems但不能做geometry），model×item达46.5%而item_id仅22.4%。\n      \n      model main effect从4.8%→14.8%递增是因为reasoning benchmarks上模型间的overall\n      performance gap更大（MMLU上4模型accuracy range ~10pp，GSM8K上可达25pp）。\n      \n      Separability在所有benchmark上<0.15%因为precision的bit-level差异对binary \n      classification的threshold crossing频率极低，这个机制与task type无关。\n      GSM8K略高（0.14%）因为multi-step computation中floating-point误差有更多\n      accumulation机会，但仍远低于0.5%阈值。\n      \n      D-study delta在GSM8K上略大（0.007 vs MMLU 0.004）因为model×item占比更高\n      意味着3-model估计对第4模型的interaction pattern预测略不精确，但仍<0.01。\n      \n      IRT/G-theory ratio从3.57到4.14是因为GSM8K上prompt×item和seed×item的\n      相对占比更高（reasoning tasks对prompt wording更敏感），G-theory需要更多items\n      来compensate这些额外variance sources。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (4 Models, Binary Scoring)\"\n        columns: [source, MMLU_pct, HellaSwag_pct, ARC_pct, GSM8K_pct, trend]\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", MMLU: 42.1, HellaSwag: 36.2, ARC: 28.5, GSM8K: 22.4, trend: \"↓ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"model\", MMLU: 4.8, HellaSwag: 7.4, ARC: 10.6, GSM8K: 14.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", MMLU: 33.6, HellaSwag: 35.8, ARC: 40.3, GSM8K: 46.5, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"prompt_template\", MMLU: 2.2, HellaSwag: 3.5, ARC: 4.2, GSM8K: 3.9, trend: \"↑ plateau\"}\n          - {source: \"temperature\", MMLU: 2.6, HellaSwag: 3.1, ARC: 2.4, GSM8K: 1.5, trend: \"↓ weak\"}\n          - {source: \"precision×method (binary)\", MMLU: 0.03, HellaSwag: 0.08, ARC: 0.11, GSM8K: 0.14, trend: \"≈0 all\"}\n          - {source: \"residual+other\", MMLU: 7.8, HellaSwag: 7.1, ARC: 6.7, GSM8K: 5.0, trend: \"↓\"}\n      - name: \"Table 7: Cross-Benchmark G_item and D-Study Budgets\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", G_item: 0.820, D_study_delta: 0.004, items_G80_practical: 414, items_G80_IRT: 116, ratio: 3.57}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", G_item: 0.812, D_study_delta: 0.004, items_G80_practical: 445, items_G80_IRT: 118, ratio: 3.77}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", G_item: 0.795, D_study_delta: 0.005, items_G80_practical: 498, items_G80_IRT: 138, ratio: 3.61}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", G_item: 0.782, D_study_delta: 0.007, items_G80_practical: 588, items_G80_IRT: 142, ratio: 4.14}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 (paper核心figure): 4-panel stacked-bar，每panel一个benchmark，\n        按knowledge→reasoning排列（MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K）。每个bar的颜色编码：\n        蓝=item_id，红=model×item，灰=model，绿=prompt，橙=temperature，浅色=其他。\n        视觉上蓝色块从左到右系统性缩小（42→22%），红色块系统性增大（34→47%），\n        形成清晰的cross-benchmark gradient。顶部标注item_id百分比和Δpp。\n        这是\"no universal recipe\"论点的direct visual evidence。\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): grouped bar chart，每benchmark两根bar\n        （IRT推荐items vs G-theory推荐items），比值标注在上方（3.6×, 3.8×, 3.6×, 4.1×）。\n        中间用虚线连接并标注\"prompt×item + seed×item + residual dimensions\"\n        解释额外items的去向。\n\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-benchmark gradient的monotonicity用Spearman rank correlation检验：\n      item_id vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=-1.0 (perfect monotonic decrease)，\n      model×item vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=+1.0 (perfect monotonic increase)。\n      MMLU matched 2×2 re-analysis确认design asymmetry effect<1%（item_id 42.1→41.8%），\n      验证reduced design的comparability。D-study cross-validation证实G-theory的\n      方差分量估计对model count的外推是可靠的，即使从3-model到4-model。\n      IRT/G-theory ratio在所有benchmark上落在3.5-4.2×范围，其中GSM8K最高是因为\n      reasoning tasks上prompt wording和random seed对specific items的影响更大\n      （chain-of-thought的variability），G-theory需要更多items来stabilize。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-003: Multi-Hardware Separability\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Multi-Hardware G-Study (Separability Crossing)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second type, e.g., A100-80GB) × 2 precisions\n      (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。\n      检验hardware×methodology separability——Claim 2的核心。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 1152000  # 4 models × 2 GPUs × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 ord × 200 items\n      gpu_types: [\"RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\", \"A100_80GB\"]\n\n      # --- Hardware-related variance components (binary scoring) ---\n      hardware_main_effect_pct: 0.02\n      hardware_x_item_pct: 0.31\n      hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.05\n      hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.03\n      hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.01\n      hardware_x_temperature_pct: 0.04\n      hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_binary_pct: 0.18\n      hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_text_pct: 0.72\n\n      # --- Comparison: single-GPU vs cross-GPU variance decomposition ---\n      cross_gpu_variance_pct:\n        item_id: 41.6\n        model: 4.7\n        model_x_item: 33.9\n        hardware: 0.02\n        hardware_x_item: 0.31\n        hardware_x_methodology: 0.18\n        prompt_template: 2.1\n        temperature: 2.7\n        seed: 0.5\n        precision: 0.01\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n        residual_and_other: 13.9\n\n      # --- Per-GPU accuracy comparison ---\n      accuracy_by_gpu:\n        RTX_PRO_6000_bf16: 0.6704\n        A100_80GB_bf16: 0.6698\n        accuracy_delta_pp: 0.06\n\n      # --- Separability confirmed under binary ---\n      separability_binary_cross_gpu: 0.18\n      separability_text_cross_gpu: 0.72\n      separability_binary_threshold_met: true   # < 0.5%\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hardware×methodology interaction在binary scoring下仅0.18%，因为两个GPU的\n      computational difference（不同CUDA core architecture, 不同memory bandwidth）\n      在binary classification层面几乎不可观测：logit值的微小差异（由hardware-specific\n      floating-point implementation引起）极少跨越0/1 classification boundary。\n      Hardware main effect仅0.02%因为两个GPU运行相同的vLLM inference stack，\n      model weights相同，只有底层compute kernel的numerical differences。\n      Hardware×item=0.31%略高于hardware×methodology，因为某些items的logit margin\n      较小（borderline items），在不同GPU上更容易flip——但这仍然极小。\n      \n      Text-exact-match下hardware×methodology升至0.72%（仍<1%但比binary高4×），\n      因为text generation的autoregressive decoding中floating-point non-associativity\n      在不同GPU architecture上有不同的error accumulation pattern，影响生成的\n      exact string。但binary scoring完全mask了这种差异。\n      \n      Cross-GPU后整体variance structure几乎不变（item_id 42.1→41.6%, model×item \n      33.6→33.9%），因为hardware facet只从residual中解释了<0.5%的variance。\n      这confirms separability：infrastructure和methodology的effects可以独立研究。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Hardware × Methodology Interaction Terms (Binary vs Text Scoring)\"\n        rows:\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×prompt\", binary_pct: 0.03, text_pct: 0.18}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×seed\", binary_pct: 0.01, text_pct: 0.08}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×temperature\", binary_pct: 0.04, text_pct: 0.22}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×precision\", binary_pct: 0.05, text_pct: 0.14}\n          - {interaction: \"hardware×ordering\", binary_pct: 0.01, text_pct: 0.05}\n          - {interaction: \"aggregate hardware×methodology\", binary_pct: 0.18, text_pct: 0.72}\n      - name: \"Table 9: Single-GPU vs Cross-GPU Variance Decomposition Stability\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", single_gpu_pct: 42.1, cross_gpu_pct: 41.6, delta: -0.5}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", single_gpu_pct: 33.6, cross_gpu_pct: 33.9, delta: 0.3}\n          - {source: \"hardware (new)\", single_gpu_pct: \"—\", cross_gpu_pct: 0.02, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"hardware×item (new)\", single_gpu_pct: \"—\", cross_gpu_pct: 0.31, delta: \"—\"}\n          - {source: \"hardware×methodology (new)\", single_gpu_pct: \"—\", cross_gpu_pct: 0.18, delta: \"—\"}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary Figure: 两列stacked-bar（RTX PRO 6000 vs A100），各benchmark\n        的variance decomposition几乎视觉identical，hardware-related components用\n        虚线outline标注但因太小几乎不可见。配inset放大图展示hardware×methodology\n        interaction在binary（0.18%）vs text（0.72%）下的差异。\n\n    analysis: >\n      Separability在binary scoring下通过两个independent GPU architecture confirmed\n      （0.18% < 0.5% threshold），直接支持Claim 2。这意味着prior isolated-factor \n      studies（如Yuan et al. 2025只研究hardware，Brittlebench只研究prompt）的\n      结论在aggregate level上可以合法组合——infrastructure和methodology的effects不\n      interact。但metric qualification仍然critical：text scoring下interaction升至\n      0.72%，虽仍<1%但已非negligible。Hardware×item的0.31%提示separability是\n      conditional on aggregation level——at the item level, hardware effects are \n      item-specific，practitioners不能假设\"换GPU对所有items影响一样\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-004: Comprehensive Analysis Suite\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      对exp-001/001b/002/003的combined data执行17项分析：\n      (a) model-as-facet, (b) bootstrap CIs, (c) D-study projections, \n      (d) REML comparison, (e) logprob scoring, (f) ranking stability, \n      (g) higher-order interactions, (h) IRT comparison, (i) power analysis,\n      (j) practitioner guide, (k) fixed vs random sensitivity, (l) binary data analysis,\n      (m) bootstrap vs jackknife, (n) design asymmetry, (o) full-scale projection,\n      (p) logprob all benchmarks, (q) GPU cost。\n      Pure analysis — no GPU compute needed。\n\n    expected_results:\n      # (a) Model-as-facet — already reflected in exp-001 cross-model results\n      model_as_facet_confirmed: true\n\n      # (b) Bootstrap CIs (1000 resamples, all experiments)\n      bootstrap_CI_widths:\n        MMLU_item_id: [36.0, 48.8]\n        MMLU_model_x_item: [28.4, 37.9]\n        MMLU_G_item: [0.782, 0.861]\n        HellaSwag_item_id: [30.1, 42.8]\n        ARC_item_id: [22.4, 35.2]\n        GSM8K_item_id: [16.2, 29.1]\n        GSM8K_model_x_item: [39.8, 53.7]\n\n      # (c) D-study benchmark-specific budgets (items × prompts × seeds for target G)\n      d_study_budgets_G80:\n        MMLU: {items: 414, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, ordering: 2, note: \"practical (prec+temp fixed)\"}\n        HellaSwag: {items: 445, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, ordering: 2}\n        ARC: {items: 498, prompts: 4, seeds: 3, ordering: 2}\n        GSM8K: {items: 588, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, ordering: 2}\n      d_study_budgets_G90:\n        MMLU: {items: 820, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, ordering: 3}\n        HellaSwag: {items: 880, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, ordering: 3}\n        ARC: {items: 985, prompts: 5, seeds: 4, ordering: 3}\n        GSM8K: {items: 1180, prompts: 5, seeds: 5, ordering: 3}\n\n      # (d) REML vs Henderson I (all experiments)\n      reml_henderson_max_diff_all_experiments_pp: 0.48\n      reml_confirms_henderson: true\n\n      # (e) Logprob scoring (third metric)\n      logprob_variance_MMLU:\n        item_id: 55.2\n        model_x_item: 28.4\n        prompt_template: 3.8\n        temperature: 0.1   # logprob less temp-sensitive than binary\n        residual_and_other: 12.5\n      logprob_G_200items: 0.584\n      logprob_note: \"Intermediate between binary (0.611) and text-exact (0.007)\"\n\n      # (f) Ranking stability — precision×temperature interaction effect on model rankings\n      ranking_stability:\n        model_rank_changes_from_precision: 0    # no rank changes under binary\n        model_rank_changes_from_temperature: 1  # Mistral/Qwen swap at T=0.7\n        rank_stability_conclusion: \"Model rankings robust to precision; temperature affects only the closest pair\"\n\n      # (g) Higher-order interaction decomposition of residual\n      residual_decomposition:\n        original_residual_pct: 19.5   # from cross-model\n        three_way_interactions_pct: 6.2\n        four_way_and_higher_pct: 2.1\n        true_residual_pct: 11.2\n        note: \"3-way interactions (model×prompt×item, model×seed×item) account for ~6% — model-conditional methodological sensitivity\"\n\n      # (h) IRT vs G-theory direct comparison\n      irt_comparison:\n        MMLU_IRT_items_G80: 116\n        MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80: 510      # all random\n        MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80_practical: 414\n        ratio_all_random: 4.40\n        ratio_practical: 3.57\n        at_IRT_116_items_Gtheory_G: 0.529\n        difference_attribution: \"prompt×item (4.6%), seed×item (4.7%), ordering×item (1.2%), and residual (21.6%) — dimensions IRT ignores\"\n        cross_benchmark_ratios: {MMLU: 4.40, HellaSwag: 3.77, ARC: 3.61, GSM8K: 4.14}\n        all_ratios_in_3_5_range: true\n\n      # (i) Power analysis\n      power_analysis:\n        design_size_conditions_x_items: \"5184 × 200\"\n        power_to_detect_2pct_interaction: 0.97\n        power_to_detect_1pct_interaction: 0.88\n        power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction: 0.72\n        conclusion: \">95% power for ≥2% effects, adequate for all claimed interactions\"\n\n      # (k) Fixed vs random sensitivity\n      fixed_vs_random:\n        temperature_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 1.8\n        ordering_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 0.4\n        both_fixed_G_range: [0.611, 0.664]\n        max_change_pct: 2.2\n        conclusion: \"All decompositions within <3% — robust to facet classification\"\n\n      # (l) Binary data Bernoulli analysis\n      binary_data:\n        bernoulli_p1p_correlation_with_item_variance: 0.42\n        null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.08\n        observed_to_null_ratio: 737.5\n        conclusion: \"Bernoulli linkage moderate (r=0.42) but item_id signal 737× null — binary artifact negligible\"\n\n      # (m) Bootstrap vs jackknife CI comparison\n      bootstrap_vs_jackknife:\n        CI_width_ratio_range: [0.94, 1.06]\n        mean_ratio: 1.00\n        conclusion: \"Independence violation from bootstrap negligible — jackknife confirms\"\n\n      # (n) Design asymmetry sensitivity (MMLU 3×3 vs matched 2×2)\n      design_asymmetry:\n        MMLU_3x3_item_id: 42.1\n        MMLU_2x2_item_id: 41.8\n        delta_pp: 0.3\n        max_component_delta_pp: 0.8\n        conclusion: \"Reduced design introduces <1pp bias on any component\"\n\n      # (o) Full-benchmark D-study projection\n      full_benchmark_projection:\n        MMLU_14K_items_G: 0.982\n        MMLU_14K_note: \"Standard MMLU with ~14K items is highly reliable even under G-theory\"\n        GSM8K_1319_items_G: 0.924\n        ARC_2590_items_G: 0.961\n\n      # (p) Logprob scoring across all benchmarks\n      logprob_cross_benchmark:\n        MMLU_logprob_item_id: 55.2\n        HellaSwag_logprob_item_id: 49.8\n        ARC_logprob_item_id: 40.1\n        GSM8K_logprob_item_id: 32.6\n        gradient_preserved: true\n        note: \"Logprob shows same monotonic gradient as binary, with higher item_id across all benchmarks (logprob is more item-sensitive)\"\n\n      # (q) GPU cost analysis\n      gpu_cost:\n        total_experiment_gpu_hours: 485\n        recommended_budget_single_benchmark_gpu_hours: 35\n        recommended_budget_4_benchmarks_gpu_hours: 140\n        cost_at_cloud_rate_per_hour_USD: 2.50\n        total_cost_single_benchmark_USD: 87.50\n        total_cost_4_benchmarks_USD: 350\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      (b) Bootstrap CIs: MMLU item_id CI [36.0, 48.8]宽度12.8pp因为200 items的\n      item-level resampling creates substantial variability，但CI不包含0且\n      item_id始终是largest component——qualitative conclusion robust。\n      \n      (e) Logprob scoring: item_id=55.2%比binary（42.1%）高因为logprob是continuous measure，\n      item difficulty的granularity更高（不只是pass/fail），temperature的影响几乎消失\n      （0.1%）因为logprob是在temperature sampling之前计算的。G=0.584比binary低因为\n      logprob的额外variance来自model×item interaction的finer-grained structure。\n      \n      (g) Higher-order interactions: 3-way interactions占6.2%主要是model×prompt×item\n      和model×seed×item——说明模型对prompt phrasing和random seed的sensitivity也是\n      item-specific的，这进一步强化了\"no universal recipe\"的narrative。\n      \n      (h) IRT ratio: 3.57-4.40×因为IRT把prompt/seed/ordering的effects全部归入\n      residual noise，而G-theory显式建模这些facets。在IRT推荐的116 items处G-theory G\n      仅0.529——意味着如果practitioner只听从IRT建议而忽略facet effects，实际reliability\n      比预期低很多。Cross-benchmark ratio在[3.5, 4.4]范围内变化，因为不同benchmark上\n      prompt×item和seed×item的relative importance不同。\n      \n      (i) Power: >95% power for ≥2% effects因为930,400 records的design scale极大，\n      即使是small interaction terms也能可靠检测。\n      \n      (n) Design asymmetry: MMLU 3×3 vs 2×2仅差0.3pp因为额外的temperature level (T=0.3)\n      和precision level (FP32)主要增加了main effects的estimation precision而非改变\n      relative decomposition结构。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: D-Study Budget Calculator (Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target G)\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", G_target: 0.80, items: 414, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 36}\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", G_target: 0.90, items: 820, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, orderings: 3, total_conditions: 96}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", G_target: 0.80, items: 445, prompts: 3, seeds: 3, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 36}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", G_target: 0.80, items: 498, prompts: 4, seeds: 3, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 48}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", G_target: 0.80, items: 588, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 64}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", G_target: 0.90, items: 1180, prompts: 5, seeds: 5, orderings: 3, total_conditions: 150}\n      - name: \"Table 11: IRT vs G-Theory Item Requirements Across Benchmarks\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", IRT_items: 116, Gtheory_items_all_random: 510, Gtheory_practical: 414, ratio_practical: 3.57, G_at_IRT_items: 0.529}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", IRT_items: 118, Gtheory_items_all_random: 480, Gtheory_practical: 445, ratio_practical: 3.77, G_at_IRT_items: 0.518}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", IRT_items: 138, Gtheory_items_all_random: 540, Gtheory_practical: 498, ratio_practical: 3.61, G_at_IRT_items: 0.492}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", IRT_items: 142, Gtheory_items_all_random: 610, Gtheory_practical: 588, ratio_practical: 4.14, G_at_IRT_items: 0.461}\n      - name: \"Table 12: Bootstrap CIs on Key Variance Components (All Benchmarks)\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", item_id_CI: \"[36.0, 48.8]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[28.4, 37.9]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.782, 0.861]\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", item_id_CI: \"[30.1, 42.8]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[30.2, 41.6]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.774, 0.855]\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", item_id_CI: \"[22.4, 35.2]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[34.1, 47.0]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.756, 0.839]\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", item_id_CI: \"[16.2, 29.1]\", model_x_item_CI: \"[39.8, 53.7]\", G_item_CI: \"[0.741, 0.828]\"}\n      - name: \"Table 13: Fixed vs Random Facet Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        rows:\n          - {scenario: \"All random (baseline)\", item_id: 42.1, model_x_item: 33.6, G: 0.611}\n          - {scenario: \"Temperature fixed\", item_id: 43.9, model_x_item: 33.8, G: 0.638}\n          - {scenario: \"Ordering fixed\", item_id: 42.5, model_x_item: 33.7, G: 0.618}\n          - {scenario: \"Both fixed\", item_id: 44.1, model_x_item: 34.0, G: 0.664}\n          - {scenario: \"Max Δ from baseline\", item_id: 2.0, model_x_item: 0.4, G: 0.053}\n      - name: \"Table 14: Binary Data Validation — Observed vs Null Simulation\"\n        rows:\n          - {metric: \"item_id (%)\", observed: 61.1, null_simulation: 0.08, ratio: 737.5}\n          - {metric: \"Bernoulli p(1-p) correlation\", value: 0.42, interpretation: \"moderate linkage — 42% of item variance covaries with Bernoulli bound\"}\n          - {metric: \"Items where obs > 2×Bernoulli\", count: 172, pct_of_200: 86.0}\n      - name: \"Table 15: Logprob Variance Decomposition Across Benchmarks\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU\", item_id: 55.2, model_x_item: 28.4, prompt: 3.8, temperature: 0.1, G: 0.584}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag\", item_id: 49.8, model_x_item: 31.2, prompt: 4.1, temperature: 0.08, G: 0.562}\n          - {benchmark: \"ARC-Challenge\", item_id: 40.1, model_x_item: 36.8, prompt: 4.5, temperature: 0.12, G: 0.531}\n          - {benchmark: \"GSM8K\", item_id: 32.6, model_x_item: 42.1, prompt: 4.2, temperature: 0.15, G: 0.498}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 3 (D-study projection curves): 4条曲线（每benchmark一条），x轴=item count\n        （50–1200），y轴=G coefficient。水平虚线标注G=0.80和G=0.90 thresholds。\n        MMLU最先到达G=0.80（414 items），GSM8K最迟（588 items）。每条曲线有shaded \n        bootstrap CI band。右侧小图展示practical vs all-random allocation的差异。\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): paired bar chart × 4 benchmarks。每pair左=IRT\n        （短bar, 116–142 items），右=G-theory（长bar, 414–588 items）。\n        Gap区域用分解条纹填充：prompt×item（蓝条纹）、seed×item（绿条纹）、\n        ordering×item（橙条纹）、residual（灰条纹），直观展示\"extra items的去向\"。\n        顶部标注ratio（3.6×–4.1×）。\n      - >\n        Figure 5 (Temperature-stratified G heatmap): 3×3 grid（或4×3），行=benchmark，\n        列=temperature（T=0.0, T=0.3, T=0.7）。每个cell颜色=G value，深绿=高G,\n        深红=低G。Binary scoring行从浅绿（G=0.76 at T=0.0）渐变到黄（G=0.55 at T=0.7）。\n        Text-exact-match行全部深红（G<0.01 for T>0）。Logprob行介于两者之间。\n\n    analysis: >\n      17项sub-analysis形成完整的methodological defense package。最关键的发现：\n      (1) IRT比较直接量化了\"忽略multi-facet reliability的hidden cost\"——在IRT推荐的\n      116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529（远低于0.80），这不是IRT\"错了\"而是它回答的是\n      不同的问题（item-only reliability vs multi-facet reliability）。\n      (2) 3-way interactions占6.2%说明even prompt sensitivity是model×item conditional的，\n      进一步巩固了\"no universal recipe\"。(3) Logprob gradient preserved意味着\n      cross-benchmark finding不是binary scoring artifact。(4) Power>95% for ≥2% effects\n      preempts underpowered concern。(5) Full-benchmark projection（MMLU 14K→G=0.982）\n      防止了\"MMLU is unreliable\"的misinterpretation。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-005: 14B Model Scale Extension\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"14B Model Scale Extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3-14B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B on datacenter GPU at BF16/FP16。\n      MMLU 200 items × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings。\n      检验variance structure是否随model scale变化。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 345600   # 2 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 ord × 200 items\n      accuracy_Qwen3_14B_bf16: 0.782\n      accuracy_DeepSeek_R1_14B_bf16: 0.758\n\n      # --- Variance decomposition (2-model crossing, bf16) ---\n      variance_14B:\n        item_id: 40.8\n        model: 3.2\n        model_x_item: 35.2\n        prompt_template: 2.5\n        temperature: 3.0\n        seed: 0.4\n        precision: 0.008\n        residual_and_other: 14.9\n\n      # --- Comparison with 7-9B ---\n      comparison_with_7_9B:\n        item_id_delta_pp: -1.3    # 42.1 → 40.8\n        model_x_item_delta_pp: 1.6  # 33.6 → 35.2\n        within_bootstrap_CI: true\n        hierarchy_preserved: true\n\n      G_item_14B: 0.808\n      G_item_7_9B: 0.820\n      G_item_delta: 0.012\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B模型的variance structure与7-9B非常接近（item_id Δ=-1.3pp, model×item Δ=+1.6pp，\n      均在bootstrap CI内），因为variance decomposition反映的是evaluation design的\n      structural properties（item difficulty distribution, prompt variation space），\n      而非model capacity per se。14B的model×item略高（35.2% vs 33.6%）因为\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled architecture对items有更distinctive的\n      interaction pattern（某些需要chain-of-thought的items上远优于Qwen3-14B，\n      但在simple retrieval items上差异消失）。G_item从0.820略降至0.808因为只有2个\n      models的crossing，估计精度更低——但仍>0.80。这个结果说明variance hierarchy\n      是evaluation design的property而非model scale的function，支持findings的\n      generalizability beyond specific model sizes。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: 14B vs 7-9B Variance Structure Comparison (MMLU)\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", \"7-9B_4models\": 42.1, \"14B_2models\": 40.8, delta: -1.3, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", \"7-9B_4models\": 33.6, \"14B_2models\": 35.2, delta: 1.6, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"model\", \"7-9B_4models\": 4.8, \"14B_2models\": 3.2, delta: -1.6, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"prompt\", \"7-9B_4models\": 2.1, \"14B_2models\": 2.5, delta: 0.4, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n          - {source: \"precision\", \"7-9B_4models\": 0.3, \"14B_2models\": 0.008, delta: -0.29, within_CI: \"yes\"}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary Figure: side-by-side stacked-bars（7-9B vs 14B），\n        视觉上几乎identical，标注\"scale-invariant variance structure\"。\n        Precision component在14B上几乎invisible（0.008%），因为14B at bf16精度已极高。\n\n    analysis: >\n      14B extension confirms variance hierarchy is scale-invariant for the studied range。\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled nature导致了slightly higher model×item\n      （architecture-specific item sensitivity），但qualitative结论unchanged。\n      Precision effect在14B上更小（0.008%）因为higher accuracy models的logit margins\n      更大，precision-induced perturbations更不可能flip classifications。\n      此结果可在Discussion中报告为generalizability evidence。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-006: Fine-Tuning G-Study (Discussion Observation)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。\n      6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task。\n      检验fine-tuning variance hierarchy是否与inference不同。\n      Downgraded to Discussion-section preliminary observation。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_runs: 1728  # 432 × 4 tasks\n      total_evaluation_records: 864000  # approximate, varies by test set size\n\n      # --- Variance decomposition by task ---\n      variance_SST2:\n        seed: 15.2\n        learning_rate: 22.8\n        data_shuffle: 8.1\n        gpu: 0.4\n        precision: 0.3\n        seed_x_lr: 12.6\n        seed_x_data: 5.8\n        gpu_x_precision: 0.5\n        residual: 34.3\n\n      variance_MNLI:\n        seed: 18.6\n        learning_rate: 25.1\n        data_shuffle: 10.4\n        gpu: 0.6\n        precision: 0.4\n        seed_x_lr: 11.2\n        seed_x_data: 6.5\n        gpu_x_precision: 0.8\n        residual: 26.4\n\n      variance_RTE:\n        seed: 38.2\n        learning_rate: 18.5\n        data_shuffle: 12.8\n        gpu: 0.9\n        precision: 0.7\n        seed_x_lr: 8.4\n        seed_x_data: 7.2\n        gpu_x_precision: 1.1\n        residual: 12.2\n\n      variance_COPA:\n        seed: 42.4\n        learning_rate: 14.8\n        data_shuffle: 14.2\n        gpu: 1.0\n        precision: 0.8\n        seed_x_lr: 7.6\n        seed_x_data: 8.1\n        gpu_x_precision: 1.5\n        residual: 9.6\n\n      # --- Key insight ---\n      seed_dominance_range_pct: [15.2, 42.4]\n      seed_dominance_inversely_correlated_with_dataset_size: true\n      gpu_x_precision_max_pct: 1.5\n      variance_hierarchy_differs_from_inference: true\n      inference_dominant: \"item_id\"\n      finetuning_dominant: \"seed\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fine-tuning的variance hierarchy fundamentally不同于inference：seed（15-42%）取代\n      item_id成为dominant source，因为random initialization + data order创建了不同的\n      loss landscape trajectories。RTE和COPA上seed占比极高（38-42%）因为dataset tiny\n      （RTE ~277 examples, COPA 100 examples），few training examples mean each random \n      seed leads to a very different local minimum。SST-2上seed较低（15%）因为dataset \n      large（67K），optimization landscape更smooth。Learning rate是second largest \n      （15-25%）因为它直接控制optimization trajectory。GPU×precision较小（0.5-1.5%）\n      但比inference高（inference <0.1%），因为fine-tuning中gradient computation的\n      floating-point差异会accumulate across thousands of training steps。\n      \n      这个结果支持论文的narrative：variance structure是conditional on evaluation \n      paradigm的——not just benchmark-conditional, but fundamentally different between \n      inference and fine-tuning。但作为encoder-only model on classification tasks，\n      不能直接generalize to decoder fine-tuning。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 17: Fine-Tuning Variance Decomposition (RoBERTa-large, 4 Tasks)\"\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"seed\", SST2: 15.2, MNLI: 18.6, RTE: 38.2, COPA: 42.4, trend: \"↑ with smaller dataset\"}\n          - {source: \"learning_rate\", SST2: 22.8, MNLI: 25.1, RTE: 18.5, COPA: 14.8, trend: \"↓ with smaller dataset\"}\n          - {source: \"data_shuffle\", SST2: 8.1, MNLI: 10.4, RTE: 12.8, COPA: 14.2, trend: \"↑ with smaller dataset\"}\n          - {source: \"gpu×precision\", SST2: 0.5, MNLI: 0.8, RTE: 1.1, COPA: 1.5, trend: \"↑ slight\"}\n          - {source: \"seed×lr\", SST2: 12.6, MNLI: 11.2, RTE: 8.4, COPA: 7.6, trend: \"↓\"}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Supplementary Figure (Discussion): stacked-bar对比 inference (MMLU, item_id dominant)\n        vs fine-tuning (RTE, seed dominant)，突出两种evaluation paradigm的variance hierarchy\n        qualitatively不同。用双色对比：inference bar以蓝(item)为主，fine-tuning bar以紫(seed)为主。\n\n    analysis: >\n      Fine-tuning G-study confirms the hypothesis that variance hierarchy is paradigm-dependent。\n      Seed dominance scales inversely with dataset size（r=-0.94 across 4 tasks），\n      consistent with Bui et al. (2025) who reported extreme seed sensitivity in \n      RoBERTa on COPA (RTES variance=18.22)。GPU×precision虽小但比inference高一个\n      数量级，因为gradient accumulation across training steps amplifies hardware-level \n      numerical differences。Explicitly qualified: RoBERTa is encoder-only on \n      classification tasks — decoder fine-tuning may differ due to autoregressive \n      generation during evaluation。This observation goes in Discussion section only。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-007: LayerCast Precision Mitigation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LayerCast Precision Mitigation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as additional precision condition on MMLU。\n      Llama-3.1-8B × 3 conditions (BF16, FP16, LayerCast) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds \n      × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 129600  # 1 model × 3 conditions × 6×6×3×4 = 432 cond × 200 items... wait let me recalculate\n      # Actually: 3 precision conditions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings = 1296 conditions × 200 items = 259,200 records\n      total_records_corrected: 259200\n\n      accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n      accuracy_fp16: 0.711\n      accuracy_layercast: 0.712\n\n      # --- Variance with LayerCast included ---\n      precision_effect_3cond_pct: 0.0004\n      precision_x_item_3cond_pct: 0.02\n      layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.10\n      layercast_vs_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.08\n\n      # --- Comparison ---\n      precision_effect_without_layercast: 0.0006\n      precision_effect_with_layercast: 0.0004\n      variance_reduction_factor: 1.5\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      LayerCast进一步压缩了已经极小的precision effect（0.0006→0.0004%），因为FP32 \n      compute消除了FP16 storage中的rare precision loss events。但改善极其marginal，\n      因为BF16和FP16之间的差异已经negligible（Δ=0.23pp accuracy），LayerCast只是\n      消除了这0.23pp中的一小部分。精度from storage→compute pipeline是完全可逆的——\n      FP16→FP32 upcast在compute时恢复了full precision，但BF16→FP32的information\n      已经在storage时丢失了，所以LayerCast主要帮助FP16 path。\n      实际价值有限：best tier下BF16已经sufficiently precise，LayerCast是一个\n      minor optimization而非necessary mitigation。适合在Appendix中brief mention。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 18: LayerCast Precision Effect\"\n        rows:\n          - {condition: \"BF16 only\", accuracy: 0.711, precision_effect_pct: \"—\"}\n          - {condition: \"FP16 only\", accuracy: 0.711, precision_effect_pct: \"—\"}\n          - {condition: \"LayerCast\", accuracy: 0.712, precision_effect_pct: \"—\"}\n          - {condition: \"BF16 vs FP16\", delta_pp: 0.23, precision_var_pct: 0.0006}\n          - {condition: \"BF16 vs FP16 vs LayerCast\", delta_pp: 0.10, precision_var_pct: 0.0004}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix figure: 3条bar（BF16, FP16, LayerCast）的accuracy with error bars，差异不可见。Inset放大precision×item component在三种条件下的变化。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      LayerCast的marginal benefit confirms BF16/FP16已sufficient for reproducible \n      LLM evaluation。P2 priority justified——这个finding最多值一段appendix text。\n      但对于use cases where even 0.0006% matters（e.g., certification/compliance），\n      LayerCast提供了一个documented mitigation path。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-008: MATH Benchmark Extension\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"MATH Benchmark (Reasoning-Heavy Extension)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings \n      × 200 MATH items。检验reasoning-heavy tasks上的variance structure，\n      特别是chain-of-thought引入的additional variance。\n\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 153600\n      accuracy_by_model:\n        Llama: 0.312\n        Gemma: 0.348\n        Mistral: 0.245\n        Qwen: 0.402\n\n      # --- Cross-model variance decomposition (binary scoring) ---\n      variance_MATH:\n        item_id: 18.1\n        model: 16.8\n        model_x_item: 50.8\n        prompt_template: 2.4\n        seed: 1.8\n        temperature: 1.2\n        precision: 0.03\n        prompt_x_item: 2.1\n        seed_x_item: 2.3\n        precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.12\n        residual_and_other: 4.4\n\n      G_item_MATH: 0.781\n\n      # --- Gradient extension (5 benchmarks) ---\n      extended_gradient_item_id:\n        MMLU: 42.1\n        HellaSwag: 36.2\n        ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n        GSM8K: 22.4\n        MATH: 18.1\n      extended_gradient_range_pp: 24.0\n      extended_gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      extended_gradient_model_x_item:\n        MMLU: 33.6\n        HellaSwag: 35.8\n        ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n        GSM8K: 46.5\n        MATH: 50.8\n      inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n\n      # --- D-study ---\n      d_study_MATH_items_G80_practical: 648\n      d_study_MATH_3to4_delta: 0.008\n      irt_gtheory_ratio_MATH: 4.56\n\n      # --- Separability ---\n      separability_binary_MATH: 0.12\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      MATH是gradient的natural endpoint：item_id仅18.1%因为数学问题的difficulty\n      极度model-specific——一道number theory题对数学强的模型trivial，对弱模型impossible，\n      这种all-or-nothing pattern使\"universal difficulty\"几乎不存在。Model×item达50.8%\n      （超过一半的variance），因为每个模型有fundamentally不同的mathematical reasoning \n      capabilities：Qwen在algebra强（可能因为训练数据中中文数学教材丰富），Gemma在\n      geometry好，Mistral整体最弱但在某些combinatorics问题上有unique strengths。\n      \n      Model main effect高达16.8%（vs MMLU 4.8%）因为MATH上模型间的overall accuracy \n      spread极大（Mistral 24.5% vs Qwen 40.2%，gap 15.7pp vs MMLU ~10pp）。\n      \n      Seed占1.8%（比MMLU高）因为chain-of-thought generation的randomness在multi-step\n      reasoning中有更多opportunity to diverge——一步走错全盘皆输。同理prompt的\n      绝对值虽相似（2.4%）但在剩余variance中的相对share更低。\n      \n      Residual仅4.4%——MATH上大部分variance都可以被identified sources解释，因为\n      binary correctness在math上更deterministic（答案对就是对，不像MMLU可能有\n      arguable answers）。\n      \n      G_item=0.781刚好在best tier threshold（≥0.78）内，因为even though model×item\n      dominates，4个模型仍然agree on some items being universally hard（e.g., \n      competition-level problems）或universally easy（e.g., basic arithmetic with \n      chain-of-thought support）。\n      \n      IRT/G-theory ratio 4.56×是最高的，因为MATH上seed×item（2.3%）和prompt×item（2.1%）\n      在low-item_id context中占relative importance更大。D-study需要648 items for G≥0.80，\n      远超MMLU的414——reasoning benchmarks上reliable evaluation更expensive。\n      \n      Extended gradient（24pp range, 5 benchmarks, perfect monotonicity）是best tier的\n      crown jewel：从MMLU到MATH，item dominance从42%降到18%，model×item从34%升到51%，\n      完美的mirror image。这直接说明\"universal reproducibility recipe\"是illusory——\n      在MMLU上\"多加items\"是最effective intervention，在MATH上\"多加models\"更重要。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 19: Extended 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient\"\n        columns: [source, MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC, GSM8K, MATH, trend]\n        rows:\n          - {source: \"item_id\", MMLU: 42.1, HellaSwag: 36.2, ARC: 28.5, GSM8K: 22.4, MATH: 18.1, trend: \"↓ monotonic (Δ=24pp)\"}\n          - {source: \"model\", MMLU: 4.8, HellaSwag: 7.4, ARC: 10.6, GSM8K: 14.8, MATH: 16.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"model×item\", MMLU: 33.6, HellaSwag: 35.8, ARC: 40.3, GSM8K: 46.5, MATH: 50.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"seed\", MMLU: 0.5, HellaSwag: 0.6, ARC: 0.8, GSM8K: 1.3, MATH: 1.8, trend: \"↑ monotonic\"}\n          - {source: \"precision×method\", MMLU: 0.03, HellaSwag: 0.08, ARC: 0.11, GSM8K: 0.14, MATH: 0.12, trend: \"≈0 all\"}\n          - {source: \"residual\", MMLU: 7.8, HellaSwag: 7.1, ARC: 6.7, GSM8K: 5.0, MATH: 4.4, trend: \"↓ monotonic\"}\n      - name: \"Table 20: MATH D-Study Budget\"\n        rows:\n          - {G_target: 0.80, items: 648, prompts: 4, seeds: 4, orderings: 2, total_conditions: 64}\n          - {G_target: 0.90, items: 1320, prompts: 5, seeds: 5, orderings: 3, total_conditions: 150}\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 extended to 5 panels (if MATH included in paper scope): \n        MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K→MATH的stacked-bar gradient。\n        蓝色(item_id)从42%到18%系统性缩小，红色(model×item)从34%到51%系统性增大，\n        形成完美的X-pattern。这是整篇论文最powerful的visual。\n      - >\n        Supplementary scatter: x轴=benchmark reasoning complexity (ordinal 1-5),\n        y轴=variance percentage。item_id和model×item两条线呈X形交叉，\n        交叉点大约在ARC-Challenge处（≈29% vs ≈40%），annotated with\n        \"item_id = model×item crossover ≈ science reasoning level\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"801973e0-9633-495e-bb39-d573a59a3496","total_cost_usd":0.9096702499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16375,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":31598,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16375,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":31598,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16375,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16375},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":11346,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.011446,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":31598,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16375,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.89822425,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_st